        <mxCell id="hybrid_neu" value="NEU REV 5 - 12 fehlende Hybrid-Aufloesungen (User-Kritik 2026-05-11 zu K10)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;§10.21  F8 PathCollapse                P02 HOT k-constrained + P04 CoCo Macro+DP + P05 START Multilevel&#xa;        Atome: KConstrainedPartitioning + MacroNodeCollapse + DataAwareCollapseDP + MultilevelCollapse&#xa;        -&gt; PathCollapseFamilyCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.22  F11 EmbeddedSecondaryIndex P11  CSS Embedded Directory&#xa;        Atome: EmbeddedDirectory + PartialPointer  -&gt; CSSEmbeddedDirectoryCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.23  F11 EmbeddedSecondaryIndex P22  Chen Fractal in-page B+&#xa;        Atome: InPageBPlus + MicroIndexing  -&gt; FractalInPageBPlusCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.24  F11 EmbeddedSecondaryIndex P26  Zhang PathPrefetcher + SearchBlockTable&#xa;        Atome: PathPrefetcher + SearchBlockTable  -&gt; ZhangSearchBlockTableCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.25  F13 CacheObliviousLayout P17    vEB + DynamicVEB + PackedMemoryArray + BufferNodes + Indirected&#xa;        Atome: VEBClassic + DynamicVEBPma + BufferNodesVEB + IndirectedVEB  -&gt; VEBLayoutVariantCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.26  F14 CacheSensitiveMultiLevel P18 MultiLevelCacheSensitive + AliasingCorrection&#xa;        Atome: MultiLevelCacheSensitive + AliasingCorrection  -&gt; SaikkonenMultiLevelCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.27  F22 CodeSpecialization P12      basic + uniform + variable&#xa;        Atome: BasicCSB + UniformCSB + VariableCSB  -&gt; CSBCodeVariantsCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.28  F22 CodeSpecialization P23      Khan TemplateSpecializer 2-5 Modify-Locations&#xa;        Atome: TemplateSpecializer + ModifyLocation[1-5]  -&gt; KhanTemplateSpecializerCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.29  F25 SyncMechaniken P07          Wormhole RCU + RW-Lock + MutEx&#xa;        Atome: Class1Rcu + Class2RWLock + Class3MutEx  -&gt; WormholeTripleConcurrencyCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.30  F25 SyncMechaniken P08          ART OLC + ROWEX&#xa;        Atome: OLC + ROWEX  -&gt; ARTSyncVariantCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.31  F27 NfpDecorator P33            VAMPIR NFP-Decorator + V-malloc + Compensation + Migration&#xa;        Atome: NfpDecorator + VMalloc + Compensation + Migration  -&gt; VampirNfpCompositionCommand&#xa;§10.32  F28 HardwareOffload P31         iDMA Configurator + AGU + DataFetcher + Crawler&#xa;        Atome: IdmaConfigurator + IdmaAgu + IdmaDataFetcher + IdmaCrawler  -&gt; UngethuemIdmaCompositionCommand" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
