        <mxCell id="iheur" value="«concept» IHeuristic&lt;H&gt; (REV 5 erweitert)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (protected) ━━━━━━━&#xa;# live_model_ : ILivePlatformModel&amp;&#xa;# property_set_ : PlatformPropertySet const&amp;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public abstract) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ recommend(input : HeuristicInput const&amp;) : Recommendation&#xa;+ estimated_value(input : HeuristicInput const&amp;) const : double&#xa;+ confidence() const noexcept : double  (0.0-1.0) ★ NEU REV 4/5 ★&#xa;+ heuristic_kind() const noexcept : HeuristicKind&#xa;━━━━━━━ Konkretisierungen (~80-85 in 8 Clustern aus K09) ━━━━━━━&#xa;C1 Layout-Selection (19) - AdaptiveLayoutSelection P01, DataAwareCollapsing P04, ProbabilityWeightedRootBlock P16, ...&#xa;C2 Cost-Modell (12) - CacheCostDP P05, OptimalNodeSize P13, OptimalWidthMultiTier P22, ...&#xa;C3 AdaptivePrefetch (8) - AdaptivePrefetchDistance P23, StrideVsSequential P32, ...&#xa;C4-C8 (siehe K09)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#4A148C;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
