        <mxCell id="patterns" value="«concept» ISearchPagesStrategyPattern Konkretisierungen (Ebene A: 21 Patterns)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Komposition (S1-S10) ━━━━━━━&#xa;S1 IAllPagesUniformPattern (P11/P12/P14/P21)&#xa;S2 ILayerMixPattern (P03/P10/P04/P22)&#xa;S3 IInnerVsLeafPattern (P02/P10/P04/P19/P22)&#xa;S4 IHotVsColdPattern (P26/P28/P10)&#xa;S5 IDynamicRebalancePattern (P05/P18/P19/P20)&#xa;S6 IHierarchicalFractalPattern (P22/P15/P06)&#xa;S7 IOrthogonalRuntimeParametrizedPattern (P23/P26/P14)&#xa;S8 IMultiStrategyOrchestrationPattern (P07/P26/P15)&#xa;S9 IHeterogeneousAdaptivePattern (P20)&#xa;S10 IBoundaryNodePartitionPattern (P20)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Adaptivitaet (S11-S16) ━━━━━━━&#xa;S11 IOfflineSelfTuningPattern (P05)&#xa;S12 IOnlineProbabilityRebalancePattern (P28/P26)&#xa;S13 IOnEveryStructureModificationPattern (P19)&#xa;S14 IPeriodicGlobalRelocationPattern (P19/P18)&#xa;S15 IBulkLoadLevelByLevelPattern (P11/P12/P14)&#xa;S16 ICompoundFastBuildPattern (P02/P04)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Aufbauverfahren (S17-S21) ━━━━━━━&#xa;S17 IBfsLevelByLevelPagePackingPattern (P18)&#xa;S18 IRecursiveDfsBlockPackingPattern (P17/P11)&#xa;S19 IProbabilityGreedyPagePackingPattern (P16/P28)&#xa;S20 IPostOrderDpPattern (P04/P05)&#xa;S21 IRecursiveCommonPrefixDecompositionPattern (P06)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE4EC;strokeColor=#880E4F;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="1140" height="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="plural" value="«concept» ISearchPagesStrategy Konkretisierungen (Ebene B: 41 Plural-Strategien in 5 Familien)&#xa;━━━━━━━ S22 BPlus-Familie (12) ━━━━━━━&#xa;BPlusTreePerLayerStrategy (P03)&#xa;ClassicBPlusTreeStrategy&#xa;CompactedSearchTreeStrategy-Full / -Level (P11)&#xa;CSBPlusTreeStrategy-Basic / -Segmented / -FullPreallocated (P12)&#xa;WideNodeBPlusStrategy pB+ (P21)&#xa;FractalBPlusStrategy-DiskFirst / -CacheFirst (P22)&#xa;LargeNodeBPlusStrategy 256-512B (P13)&#xa;EmbeddedSecondaryIndexStrategy B^2 (P06)&#xa;━━━━━━━ S23 Trie-Familie (8) ━━━━━━━&#xa;AdaptiveRadixTreeStrategy (P01)&#xa;MultilevelAdaptiveRadixStrategy (P05)&#xa;KConstrainedHotStrategy (P02)&#xa;MacroNodeCollapsingStrategy CoCo (P04)&#xa;LoudsDenseSparseStrategy (P10)&#xa;JacobsonLoudsStrategy (P09)&#xa;WormholeTripleStrategy (P07)&#xa;PathCompressedTrieStrategy (P01/P02)&#xa;━━━━━━━ S24 Hybrid-Familie (8) + S25 Layout-Theorie (14) + S26 Adaptive-Selectors (3) ━━━━━━━&#xa;TripleHashThenBPlus / EmbeddedDecisionSpanTree / JumpPointerArray-Ext/Int / DualJumpPointerArray /&#xa;JumpPointerVersionChain / MicroIndexing | vEB-Varianten / CacheSensitiveMultiLevel / LocalReloc /&#xa;ProbabilityWeighted / CacheOblivious / BTreeOfCacheLines / VerticalPartitioning / HotPathLayout |&#xa;AdaptiveLeafSelector / OfflineSelfTuning / ConfigurationLookup" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="160" width="1140" height="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="singular" value="«concept» ISearchPageStrategy Konkretisierungen (Ebene C: 74 Singular-Strategien)&#xa;━━━━━━━ S27 Intra-Page Search (22) ━━━━━━━&#xa;LinearScanWithinNode | BinarySearchWithinNode | LoopUnrolledBinarySearch | SimdParallelKeyComparison-SSE/AVX2 |&#xa;SimdParallelHeadComparison | Fingerprinting-PointLookup | DenseOffsetLookup-FDL | HintNarrowedBinarySearch |&#xa;InterpolationSearch | PoorMansNormalizedKeySearch | RankSelectNavigation | TaggedHashSlotLookup | SpeculativeHashedAccess |&#xa;IncrementalHashing | LoudsLookup | DfudsRankAccess | ExtensionSpanSearch-B^2 | ByteRangeDecision-B^2 |&#xa;DiscriminativeBitsSelection | PrefixingLinearSearch | TwoCandidatePrefetchBinarySearch&#xa;━━━━━━━ S28 Intra-Page Insert/Update (15) ━━━━━━━&#xa;PermutationFieldInsertion (P03) | AdaptiveLayoutInsertion (P20) | KConstrainedSubtreePartitioning (P02 4-Wege) |&#xa;LazyDeletion | LazySortInsertion-Fingerprinting | SequentialInsertHeuristic | SmartSplit | BulkLoadLevelByLevel |&#xa;InsertionPathPrefetch | SiblingRedistributionPrefetch | RebuildOnSplit-B^2 | BoundaryAwareSeparatorSelection-FDL |&#xa;NodeReplacement-ROWEX | OverflowLeaf-Wormhole | ContentionSplit&#xa;━━━━━━━ S29 Intra-Page Layout/Encoding (28) ━━━━━━━&#xa;PrefixTruncation | Heads-PoorMansNormalized | Hints | Fingerprinting-LeafLayout | SDL | FDL | IndirectionVector |&#xa;InfixSpeicherung-B^2 | SpanNodeLcpCompression-B^2 | LinearizedCompoundNode-HOT | PointerElimination |&#xa;NodeGroupContiguous | SegmentedNodeGroup | OrderPreservingCompression | KeyNormalization | NextNeighborDifferencing |&#xa;PointerToExtentsCompression | IntegerSliceFormation | AdaptiveSuffixPlacement | PartialKeyEncoding | LcpAwareIntegerEncoding |&#xa;EncodingSelection | AlphabetAwareEncoding | SuffixTruncation | PerNodeTypeFindChild | MultilevelNode | RewiredNode | MultilevelNode4&#xa;━━━━━━━ S30 Concurrency innerhalb Page (9, 2 Hybride NEU §9.21+§9.22) ━━━━━━━&#xa;OptimisticLockCoupling-OLC | ROWEX | RCU | HazardPointers | EpochBasedReclamation | HandOverHandOptimistic |&#xa;QuiescentStateBased | TripleClassConcurrency-Wormhole NEU | CopyOnWrite | DualHashTableCopyOnWrite NEU" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="780" width="2320" height="640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hint" value="HINWEIS: Diese Konkretisierungen sind als Concept-Konkretisierungen modelliert (analog 11_md F1-F29). Jede konkrete Klasse erbt von einem Concept-Header (`i_*.hpp`).&#xa;Hybrid-Aufloesungen via 17 + 5 NEU REV 5 + 12 NEU K10 HybridCompositionCommands (siehe U04). F15-Permutation Saeule A x Saeule B (siehe K12)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1440" width="2320" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="U08" name="U08 PRT_ART vollstaendige Klasse">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="U08 UML - comdare::prt_art vollstaendige Klasse (REV 5)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1B5E20;strokeColor=#0D3F11;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Vollstaendige Klassen-Definition: 7-Quellen-Hybrid + 6 Seitentypen + alle Iteratoren + alle Operationen + ValueHandle" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1B5E20;fontColor=#1B5E20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="prtart" value="template &lt;typename Key, typename Value, typename Allocator = std::allocator&lt;std::pair&lt;Key const, Value&gt;&gt;&gt;&#xa;class comdare::prt_art : public ISearchEngine&#xa;━━━━━━━ Typen (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ using key_type = Key&#xa;+ using mapped_type = Value&#xa;+ using value_type = std::pair&lt;Key const, Value&gt;&#xa;+ using size_type = std::size_t&#xa;+ using allocator_type = Allocator&#xa;+ using value_handle = ValueHandle  // Inline | External | ChainRef&#xa;━━━━━━━ Iterator-Typen (Pflicht REV 5) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ class iterator                  - mutable forward iterator (operator++ / operator* / operator-&gt;)&#xa;+ class const_iterator&#xa;+ class reverse_iterator&#xa;+ class const_reverse_iterator&#xa;+ class range_iterator            - lex-Modus, getrange-Semantik aus Masstree&#xa;+ class key_iterator&#xa;+ class value_iterator&#xa;+ class prefix_iterator           - NEU REV 5 fuer Prefix-Lookup&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- root_page_ : IRootPage&amp; (CoCo Trie-Huelle)&#xa;- page_pool_ : SeitentypPool {Redirect / DenseByte / Multilevel / SparsePatricia / DecisionSpan / CustomAligned}&#xa;- value_storage_ : ValueStorage (Inline-Pool + External-Pool + ChainRef-Pool)&#xa;- cache_engine_ref_ : optional&lt;CacheEngine&amp;&gt;&#xa;- pages_strategy_pattern_ : ISearchPagesStrategyPattern&amp;&#xa;- iterator_modes_ : IteratorMode (Default / LokalGeordnet / Lex)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Pflicht-Operationen (Termin 1+2 Vergleichsmatrix) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ optional&lt;Value&gt; lookup(Key const&amp;) const                                       - exact lookup successful&#xa;+ optional&lt;Value&gt; lookup_or_default(Key const&amp;, Value const&amp;) const               - exact lookup unsuccessful&#xa;+ prefix_iterator prefix_lookup(Key const&amp; prefix) const                          - prefix lookup&#xa;+ iterator prefix_enumeration(Key const&amp; prefix) const                            - prefix enumeration (forward)&#xa;+ range_iterator range_scan(Key const&amp; begin, Key const&amp; end) const              - getrange Lex-Modus&#xa;+ pair&lt;iterator, bool&gt; insert(value_type const&amp;)                                  - insert&#xa;+ size_type erase(Key const&amp;)                                                     - delete&#xa;+ template&lt;typename V&gt; void update(Key const&amp;, V&amp;&amp;)                              - update&#xa;+ static prt_art bulk_build(span&lt;value_type const&gt; sorted_pairs)                  - bulk build&#xa;+ void compact_rebuild()                                                          - konsolidierter Rebuild&#xa;━━━━━━━ Standard-API (kompatibel zu std::map, Domaenenmodell §1A) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ size_type size() const noexcept | bool empty() const noexcept | void clear()&#xa;+ iterator begin() / end() / cbegin() / cend() / rbegin() / rend() / crbegin() / crend()&#xa;+ allocator_type get_allocator() const noexcept" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="900" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hint" value="HINWEIS REV 5: Iteratoren werden VOLLSTAENDIG implementiert (User-Direktive: &#39;in all unseren Arbeiten immer vollstaendig&#39;).&#xa;ValueHandle::Inline / External / ChainRef ist H3-Hypothese (Termin 4) und MUSS aktiv ueber Kostenmodell gewaehlt werden.&#xa;Compile-Time Seitenfamilie + Runtime Umschaltregeln (Termin 1) = HybridCompositionCommand-Pattern (siehe U04)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1080" width="2320" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K15" name="K15 ICacheEngine-Familien-Taxonomie C1-C12">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1700" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1700" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K15 KONZEPT - ICacheEngine-Familien-Taxonomie C1-C12 (NEU REV 5.1 - Pendant zu K06 ISearchEngine)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#01579B;strokeColor=#003C71;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="WICHTIG: F1-F29 in K10 sind WAHL-OPTIONEN; C1-C12 sind die INTERNAL COMPONENTS der Cache-Engine. ~264 atomare Bausteine + ~30 Hybride." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#01579B;fontColor=#01579B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c1" value="C1 Cache-Layout-Engine (~26 Atoms)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Knoten-Format und Footprint&#xa;Hostet F1/F3/F4/F8/F11/F12/F13/F14/F15/F16/F17/F19/F22&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Atoms: Node4/16/48/256 (P01 ART), Single/MultiMask 8/16/32 PKEY (P02 HOT),&#xa;MultilevelNode + RewiredVirtualPhysical (P05 START), Segmented/FullPrealloc/&#xa;BasicSinglePointer (P12 CSB+), CacheLineSizedNode (P11), MultiCacheLineNode (P03/P21),&#xa;EmbeddedSecondaryIndex (P06/P11), IndirectionVector (P03/P15), CacheObliviousVEB (P17),&#xa;CacheSensitiveMultiLevel (P18), HotPathLinear (P28), ProbabilityWeightedRootBlock (P16),&#xa;PoorMansNormalizedKey (P15/P20), PrefixTruncation (P20), OrderPreservingHuffman (P15),&#xa;CodeSpecializedSearch (P11/P12/P14/P23), StridedPadded (P32)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Hybride: HOT-9-Layout-Pool, START-Multilevel+Rewired, CSB+ 3-Allocation, B-Tree-adaptive 4-Layout" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c2" value="C2 Cache-Pinning-Engine (~10 Atoms)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;NUMA / Core / Tier-Bindung&#xa;Ergaenzt F18/F25&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Atoms: FirstTouchPinning (P28), NumactlBind (P25/P32),&#xa;PerCpuQuiescent (P29 RCU), PerThreadHazard (P30 HP),&#xa;CrossSocketAvoidance (P03/P25), LargestL3CcdPinning (Auto, ehemals X3D),&#xa;HotPathOnHighIpcCore (Auto, ehemals IntelHybrid),&#xa;MicroServerCpuBinding (P15), CoreManagerPinning (P31),&#xa;IntelThreadDirectorHint (Block AO i9-14900KS)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Hybride: Wormhole-3-Klassen-Scheduling (P07), Tomahawk-CoreManager (P31)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1200" y="160" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c3" value="C3 Cache-Prefetch-Engine (~25 Atoms)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Latenz-Hiding: T0/T1/T2/NTA/lfetch/KEEP/STREAM,&#xa;WideNodePrefetch (P21), JumpPointerArray-Ext/Int (P21/P22/P26),&#xa;DualJumpCachePlusDisk (P22), CoroutineFullNode/HalfNode (P25),&#xa;BundlePrefetch d=90 (P27), StridedScalar (P32), PartitionStride 30-42 (P32),&#xa;PathPrefetch + MonitorPrefetch + CachePrefetchInsideNode (P26),&#xa;PostLocationCheck (P15), MultiRecordHint (P15), TwoNodesAheadRangeScan (P14),&#xa;RuntimeAdaptiveDistance + AffineDistance + TemplateSpecializer (P23 Khan)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Hybride: ThreePrefetcherOrch (P26), KhanDynamicSpecializer (P23), CoroutineSelection (P25),&#xa;ItaniumPrefetch (P14), GraefePrefetchSurvey (P15), ChenPrefetchedBPlus (P21)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="500" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c4" value="C4 Cache-Coherence-Engine (~12 Atoms)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Reader/Writer-Asymmetrie + Sync&#xa;Hostet F18/F25&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Atoms: OptimisticLockCoupling (P03/P06/P08), Rowex (P02/P08),&#xa;RcuQsbr (P29/P07), RcuMembarrier, RcuSignal (URCU 6-Flavor),&#xa;HazardPointer (P30), EpochBasedReclamation, HtmTransactional (P08),&#xa;HandOverHandLocking (P03), Cow (P02), MfenceLfence (P05/P29),&#xa;NoSharedWrite (P03/P08/P29/P30)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Hybride: Wormhole 3-Class-Sync (P07), ART-OLC + ROWEX (P08), HOT-COW + Obsolete-Marker (P02)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1200" y="500" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c5" value="C5 Cache-Telemetry-Engine (~22 Atoms)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Mess- + Probe-Strategien (Hostet F23/F24)&#xa;PerNodeCounter (P28 - mit Coherence-Falle!),&#xa;LeafOnlyCounter + LeafOnlySampledCounter&lt;N&gt; + RetroactiveAggregation (P28-Mail NEU 2026-05-08),&#xa;PathReadCounter + MonitorClustering (P26), JaccardSimilarity + BundleIdentification + CompressionBufferFifo (P27),&#xa;HotPathExtraction (P28), FbFullCounter (P25),&#xa;Clflush/Latency/Perfmon/Papi/VTune-Probe, CardenasFormula (P13),&#xa;SlidingWindowDrift (P28-Future), ReuseDistance + OverpredictionGate (P24)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="840" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c6" value="C6 Cache-Allocation-Engine (~17 Atoms)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Allocator + Tier-Auswahl (Hostet F1/F12/F21/F27)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Malloc, Jemalloc, Mimalloc, MmapAnonymous, MemfdCreate (P05),&#xa;RewiredVirtualPhysicalAllocator (P05), HugePages, NumaLocalAllocator (P25/P32),&#xa;HbmAllocation (P25/P33), LpddrAllocation (P25 Grace), NvramAllocation (P33),&#xa;CxlAllocation (Future), PoolAllocator, SegmentedAllocator (P12),&#xa;OverflowPageAllocator (P22), NfpDecorator (P33), VMalloc (P33)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Hybride: VAMPIR V-malloc + Compensation (P33), START Rewiring + memfd (P05), Multi-Tier-Allocator HBM+DRAM+NVRAM" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1200" y="840" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c7" value="C7 Cache-Migration-Engine (~12 Atoms)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Tier-Migration + Compensation (F9/F19/F27)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;HotColdSegregation (P02/P05/P10), LayerCutoff R=64 (P10 SuRF),&#xa;MultiTierMigration Cache+Disk (P22), DramHbmMigration (P25/P33),&#xa;CompensationMigration (P33), LocalRelocation alpha 1-6 (P19), GlobalRelocation BFS (P19),&#xa;LayoutInvariantPreservation (P19), HotPathRefresh (P28+P28-Mail), BulkUpdateRebuild (P04),&#xa;OnlineSelfTuningTrigger (P05), LayoutDegradationTrigger (P19)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Hybride: Saikkonen Local+Global (P19), Kuehn Hot-Path-Refresh (P28-Mail), VAMPIR Compensation (P33)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1180" width="1140" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c8" value="C8 Cache-Encoding-Engine (~28 Atoms)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Topologie + Bit-Packing (F2/F10/F16/F17/F19/F20)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;LoudsEncoding + LoudsDense + LoudsSparse (P09/P10), DfudsEncoding, BalancedParentheses,&#xa;PointerTopology, BitArrayTopology, EliasFano + PackedArray + Bitvector + Dense (P04 CoCo),&#xa;PointerTag (P01/P02/P05/P07), OrderPreservingHuffman + KeyNormalization + PrefixSuffixTrunc + NextNeighborDiff (P15),&#xa;RankSelectPrimitive + BlockOrientedRankSelect (P09/P10), JacobsonTwoLevelDirectory + PoppyRank,&#xa;PartialKeyEncoding 8/16/32 (P02), SuRFBase/Hash/Real/Mixed (P10),&#xa;WAH/PLWAH/COMPAX (P31)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Hybride: CoCo Encoding-Pool, SuRF Cutoff-Hybrid, SuRF Filter-Pool, Graefe Compression-Suite" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1200" y="1180" width="1140" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c9_12" value="C9 Cache-Heuristik-Engine (~73 Atoms ORTHOGONAL) + C10 Cache-Topologie-Engine (~17) + C11 Cache-Scheduler-Engine (~13) + C12 Cache-Filter-Engine (~9)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;C9 Heuristik (orthogonal): Layout-Selection + Cost-Modell + AdaptivePrefetchDistance + Workload-Detection + Coherence-Pressure + Telemetry-getrieben + Search-Strategy-Selection + Workload-Mix + Hardware-Probing&#xa;Hybride: Samuel ConfigurationTable (P14), Khan DynamicSpecializer (P23), Hankins-Patel Cost-Modell (P13), Block-AO Production-Dispatch&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;C10 Topologie (Saeule-B-Adapter): Cpuid + Sysfs + Hwloc + ProcCpuinfo + ClflushCycle + AllPairsPinning + CacheCoherenceCost + TlbCapacity + PrefetcherStream + AsymmetricL3 + HybridCore + HbmTier + IsaFeatureSet + InterconnectTopology + MemoryBandwidth + NumaTopology + PropertyPublisher&#xa;Hybride: 5-Schritt Auto-Discovery (REV3), Block AO Auto-Discovery, Multi-Tool-Probe&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;C11 Scheduler: OfflineSelfTuning (P05) + PeriodicGlobalReloc (P19) + MicroServerScheduler (P15) + WorkerThreadAsync (P26) + CoreManagerScheduler (P31) + MultiQueryPipeline (P33) + OptimisticLocking (P03/P06/P08) + RcuGracePeriod (P29) + HazardPointer (P30) + Htm (P08) + BackgroundCheckpoint (P03) + RebalanceAmortization (P17) + RetroactiveAggregation (P28-Mail)&#xa;Hybride: Wormhole 3-Class-Scheduler (P07), Tomahawk Core Manager (P31), Kuehn Hot-Path-Scheduler (P28-Mail)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;C12 Filter (F29): BloomFilter, SuRFFilter (P10), CuckooFilter, AdaptiveRangeFilter, SuRF 4 Encoding-Varianten, FalsePositiveRateModel, FilterStorageMedium&#xa;Hybride: SuRF Filter-Pool mit FPR-Tuning (P10)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1440" width="2300" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="U09" name="U09 ICacheEngine UML State+Visitor+Pipeline (REV 5.2)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1900" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="2400" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="U09 UML - ICacheEngine als State-Pattern + Visitor-Pattern + Pipeline (REV 5.2 KOMPLETT NEU)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#01579B;strokeColor=#003C71;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Klassisches UML: ICacheEngine ist Visitor (bedient Requester) + State-Pattern (monitort Plattform) + Pipeline-Mediator (orchestriert 12 Sub-Engines C1-C12). Quellen: extract_state_visitor_per_paper.md + extract_state_visitor_pattern.md + 33-Paper-Lektuere." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#01579B;fontColor=#01579B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="layer_request" value="REQUEST-INTERFACE - aufrufende ISearchPageStrategy / ICacheStrategy" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;fontColor=#E65100;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="2320" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ctx" value="«struct» RequestContext (Read-only Snapshot vom Caller)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ caller_engine : IExecutingEngine const&amp;&#xa;+ search_page : ISearchPage const&amp;&#xa;+ search_page_structure : ISearchPageStructure const&amp;&#xa;+ requested_inode : INode const&amp;&#xa;+ operation_kind : enum {Lookup, Insert, Erase, RangeScan, PrefixScan, BulkBuild, Compact}&#xa;+ key : KeyView&#xa;+ value_size_hint : optional&lt;size_t&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="180" width="1100" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rec" value="«struct» CacheRecommendation (Rueckgabe an Caller, NICHT void!)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ verdict : enum {DoNothing, Hint, Reshape, Migrate, Allocate, Abort}&#xa;+ alloc_hint : optional&lt;MemoryAllocationHint&gt;     (NEU Speicher mit Tier-Wahl)&#xa;+ layout_proposal : optional&lt;LayoutChangeProposal&gt; (Knoten-Geometrie aendern)&#xa;+ prefetch_advice : optional&lt;PrefetchAdvisory&gt;     (Distance + Targets + Mode)&#xa;+ migration_directive : optional&lt;MigrationDirective&gt; (Tier-Wechsel)&#xa;+ pinning_directive : optional&lt;PinningDirective&gt;   (Core-Bindung)&#xa;+ pressure_summary : PressureSummary               (fuer Telemetry)&#xa;+ confidence : double  (0.0-1.0)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1180" y="180" width="1180" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="layer_engine" value="ICACHE-ENGINE - Mediator + Pipeline + State-Holder" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;fontColor=#01579B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="440" width="2320" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ice" value="«concept» ICacheEngine (Top-Level Entry-Point fuer Caller)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- pressure_state_ : PressureState                  (State-Pattern Aggregat - siehe unten)&#xa;- sub_engines_ : array&lt;unique_ptr&lt;ISubEngine&gt;, 12&gt; (12 Pipeline-Stufen C1-C12)&#xa;- snapshot_cache_ : optional&lt;PlatformSnapshot&gt;     (TTL-basiert, ~100 ms)&#xa;- recommendation_history_ : RingBuffer&lt;CacheRecommendation&gt; (Telemetry/Audit)&#xa;- mediator_dispatch_ : function&lt;void(SubEngineEvent)&gt; (Sub-Engine-Koordination)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) - Externes Interface ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ advise(ctx : RequestContext const&amp;) : CacheRecommendation&#xa;+ snapshot() const : PlatformSnapshot&#xa;+ register_sub_engine(slot : SubEngineSlot, engine : unique_ptr&lt;ISubEngine&gt;) : void&#xa;+ on_pressure_transition(from : PressureState, to : PressureState) : void&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (private) - Mediator-Pattern Interna ━━━━━━━&#xa;- run_pipeline(snap : PlatformSnapshot, ctx : RequestContext) : CacheRecommendation&#xa;- merge(running : CacheRecommendation, delta : CacheRecommendation) : CacheRecommendation&#xa;- notify(sender : ISubEngine*, event : SubEngineEvent) : void&#xa;━━━━━━━ Pattern-Rolle ━━━━━━━&#xa;Visitor-Wurzel (von aussen besucht durch ISearchPageStrategy)&#xa;Mediator (koordiniert die 12 Sub-Engines)&#xa;State-Holder (haelt PressureState als std::variant)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="480" width="2320" height="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="layer_state" value="STATE-PATTERN - Plattform-Zustand-Modellierung (5 Konkrete States)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#4A148C;fontColor=#4A148C;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="940" width="2320" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ps" value="using PressureState = std::variant&lt; Idle, Warmup, Saturated, CoherenceStorm, Recovery &gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━ C++23 std::variant (statt klassischer GoF-Hierarchie - value-Semantik, Compile-Time-Exhaustiveness) ━━━━━━━&#xa;«struct» Idle           - Cache-Druck &lt; 30 Prozent, last_check_ns&#xa;«struct» Warmup         - mpki, pages_loaded - Khan 2010 Stil&#xa;«struct» Saturated      - bandwidth_util, mshr_pressure - Mahling 2025 weak-reliability&#xa;«struct» CoherenceStorm - inter_socket_msgs_per_us, affected_sockets - Stenstroem-Analyse&#xa;«struct» Recovery       - remaining ms - Naderan-Tahan 2016 Negative-State&#xa;━━━━━━━ State-Transitions (Trigger aus 33-Paper-Tieflektuere) ━━━━━━━&#xa;Idle -&gt; Warmup           : erste Zugriffe, MPKI &gt; 0&#xa;Warmup -&gt; Saturated      : Bandwidth-Util &gt; 80%, MSHR-Stalls (P25 Mahling, P21 Chen)&#xa;Saturated -&gt; CoherenceStorm : Cross-Socket-Traffic &gt; Threshold (P28 Block AN, P03 Masstree)&#xa;CoherenceStorm -&gt; Recovery : Stress-Reduktion, kuehlende Caches&#xa;Recovery -&gt; Idle         : Steady-State erreicht&#xa;━━━━━━━ Negative-State-Detection (P24 Naderan-Tahan) ━━━━━━━&#xa;Wenn Hit-Rate von Prefetch &lt; 30%, dann verdict=DoNothing (Negative-Recommendation)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#4A148C;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="980" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="layer_visitor" value="VISITOR-PATTERN - Acyclic mit Rueckgabe (Praezedenz LLVM InstVisitor&lt;SubClass, RetTy&gt;)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;fontColor=#1B5E20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1380" width="2320" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ievis" value="«concept» ICacheEngineVisitor (Acyclic-Visitor-Wurzel - Robert C. Martin)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Marker-Interface ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ virtual ~ICacheEngineVisitor() = default&#xa;━━━━━━━ Pro-State Visitor-Interface (Sub-Visitor) ━━━━━━━&#xa;template&lt;class StateT&gt;&#xa;«concept» VisitorFor&lt;StateT&gt; : public virtual ICacheEngineVisitor&#xa;  + virtual visit(state : StateT const&amp;, ctx : RequestContext const&amp;) : CacheRecommendation = 0&#xa;━━━━━━━ Konkretisierungen ━━━━━━━&#xa;VisitorFor&lt;Idle&gt;             - liefert DoNothing&#xa;VisitorFor&lt;Warmup&gt;           - liefert IncreasePrefetch (mpki)&#xa;VisitorFor&lt;Saturated&gt;        - liefert ThrottlePrefetch (mshr_pressure)&#xa;VisitorFor&lt;CoherenceStorm&gt;   - liefert PinHotPages (affected_sockets)&#xa;VisitorFor&lt;Recovery&gt;         - liefert WaitAndMeasure" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1420" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iestate" value="«concept» ICacheEngineState (akzeptiert Visitor)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ virtual ~ICacheEngineState() = default&#xa;+ virtual accept(visitor : ICacheEngineVisitor&amp;, ctx : RequestContext const&amp;) const : CacheRecommendation = 0&#xa;━━━━━━━ Modern-C++23-Alternative (Overload-Pattern + std::visit) ━━━━━━━&#xa;CacheRecommendation react(state : PressureState const&amp;, ctx : RequestContext const&amp;)&#xa;{ return std::visit(Overload{&#xa;    [](Idle const&amp;)            { return CacheRecommendation::DoNothing(); },&#xa;    [](Warmup const&amp; w)        { return CacheRecommendation::IncreasePrefetch(w.mpki); },&#xa;    [](Saturated const&amp; s)     { return CacheRecommendation::ThrottlePrefetch(s.mshr_pressure); },&#xa;    [](CoherenceStorm const&amp; c){ return CacheRecommendation::PinHotPages(c.affected_sockets); },&#xa;    [](Recovery const&amp;)        { return CacheRecommendation::WaitAndMeasure(); }&#xa;}, state); }" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="1420" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="layer_pipeline" value="PIPELINE - 12 Sub-Engines in deterministischer Reihenfolge (Telemetry first, Behavior last)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;fontColor=#01579B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1760" width="2320" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="isub" value="«concept» ISubEngine (Pipeline-Stufe + Mediator-Teilnehmer)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public abstract) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ virtual name() const noexcept : string_view&#xa;+ virtual family_kind() const noexcept : SubEngineSlot  (z.B. C03_Prefetch)&#xa;+ virtual advise(snap : PlatformSnapshot, ctx : RequestContext, running : CacheRecommendation) : CacheRecommendation = 0&#xa;+ virtual on_event(event : SubEngineEvent) : void   (Mediator-Callback)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1800" width="1140" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pipe_order" value="PIPELINE-REIHENFOLGE (deterministisch)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;1.  C05 Telemetry      - PMU-Sampling, MPKI, FB_FULL (P25/P26/P27/P28)&#xa;2.  C10 Topologie      - NUMA, Cache-Hierarchie (P05/P25/P28/P32/P33)&#xa;3.  C09 Heuristik      - liest State + Topologie -&gt; Decision (alle 33 Paper)&#xa;4.  C01 Layout         - Knoten-Geometrie (P01/P02/P05/P11/P12/P13/P15/P16/P17/P20)&#xa;5.  C08 Encoding       - Bit-Packing, Path-Compression (P04/P09/P10/P15/P31)&#xa;6.  C06 Allocation     - Tier-Auswahl, Pool (P05/P22/P25/P31/P33)&#xa;7.  C02 Pinning        - Core-Bindung (P03/P25/P28/P29/P31/P32/P33)&#xa;8.  C07 Migration      - Tier-Migration (P19/P22/P25/P28/P33)&#xa;9.  C03 Prefetch       - Latenz-Hiding (P02/P14/P21/P22/P23/P25/P26/P27)&#xa;10. C04 Coherence      - MOESI-Beobachtung (P03/P06/P07/P08/P28/P29/P30)&#xa;11. C12 Filter         - Spaetfilter (P10 SuRF)&#xa;12. C11 Scheduler      - Background-Defrag (P05/P15/P26/P28/P29/P31/P33)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Begruendung: Information first, Structure second, Allocation third, Behavior last" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="1800" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="impl" value="C++ Pipeline-Implementierung (von ICacheEngine.advise() aufgerufen)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;CacheRecommendation ICacheEngine::advise(RequestContext const&amp; ctx) {&#xa;  PlatformSnapshot snap = make_snapshot();                              // C10 Topologie + C05 Telemetry&#xa;  pressure_state_ = classify_pressure(snap);                            // State-Update&#xa;  CacheRecommendation acc = std::visit(state_overload, pressure_state_); // Visitor-Pattern Wurzel&#xa;  for (auto&amp; sub : sub_engines_) {                                       // Pipeline ueber 12 Sub-Engines&#xa;    CacheRecommendation delta = sub-&gt;advise(snap, ctx, acc);&#xa;    acc = merge(acc, delta);&#xa;    if (delta.verdict == Verdict::Abort) break;                          // Frueh-Ausstieg&#xa;  }&#xa;  recommendation_history_.push(acc);&#xa;  return acc;                                                            // an Caller (ISearchPageStrategy)&#xa;}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="2020" width="2320" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hint" value="MUSTER-ZUSAMMENFASSUNG (REV 5.2):&#xa;ICacheEngine ist gleichzeitig Visitor (von aussen) + Mediator (zwischen Sub-Engines) + State-Holder (Plattform-Zustand) + Pipeline-Orchestrator (deterministische 12-Sub-Engine-Reihenfolge).&#xa;Caller ISearchPageStrategy ruft engine.advise(ctx) und erhaelt CacheRecommendation mit konsolidierter Empfehlung.&#xa;Praezedenz: LLVM InstVisitor&lt;SubClass, RetTy&gt; (Visitor mit Rueckgabe), Java HotSpot CompilerVisitor (Pipeline), Mediator-Pattern Refactoring.guru, GoF State-Pattern modernisiert via std::variant + std::visit + P2637R3." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="2240" width="2320" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_ctx_ice" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.3;entryY=0;endArrow=open;startArrow=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ctx" target="ice">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_ctx_lbl" value="Caller passt RequestContext" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;background=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#E65100;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="r_ctx_ice">
          <mxGeometry x="-0.1" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_ice_rec" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.7;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;endArrow=open;startArrow=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ice" target="rec">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_ice_lbl" value="Engine liefert CacheRecommendation" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;background=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#E65100;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="r_ice_rec">
          <mxGeometry x="-0.1" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_ice_ps" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;endArrow=diamondThin;endFill=1;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#4A148C;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ice" target="ps">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_ice_lbl2" value="haelt 1 PressureState" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;background=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#4A148C;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="r_ice_ps">
          <mxGeometry x="-0.1" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_ievis_iestate" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;endArrow=open;startArrow=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ievis" target="iestate">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_visit_lbl" value="visit (Acyclic) / std::visit (Modern)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;background=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B5E20;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="r_ievis_iestate">
          <mxGeometry x="-0.1" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_isub_pipe" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;endArrow=open;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="isub" target="pipe_order">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_isub_lbl" value="12 Pipeline-Stufen" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;background=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="r_isub_pipe">
          <mxGeometry x="-0.1" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K07a" name="K07a Discover-Phase Atoms">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1700" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K07a KONZEPT - IPlatformProbe DISCOVER-Phase (Sub-Split aus K07, REV 5.3)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1A237E;strokeColor=#0D1A66;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Schritt 1 von 5 - Statische Plattform-Erkennung ueber CPUID/sysfs/hwloc/ProcCpuinfo. ALLE Discover-Atoms aus 33 Papern + Standard-Tools." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A237E;fontColor=#1A237E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g_static" value="STATISCHE DISCOVER-ATOMS (Hardware-Identitaet aus OS/CPU-Registern)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;CpuidProbeAtom              - x86 CPUID-Instruction (Vendor, Family, Model, Stepping, Cache-Level-Sizes)&#xa;SysfsProbeAtom               - Linux /sys/devices/system/cpu/ (Topologie, Core-IDs, Cache-Sharing)&#xa;HwlocProbeAtom               - libhwloc Portable Topology (NUMA-Nodes, Bindings, Affinity-Masks)&#xa;ProcCpuinfoProbeAtom         - Linux /proc/cpuinfo (Flags, Frequency, Model-Name)&#xa;CpuFeaturesProbeAtom         - cpu_features library (gcc __builtin_cpu_supports + ARM HWCAP)&#xa;DmidecodeProbeAtom           - SMBIOS DMI Tables (Memory-Channels, DIMM-Specs, Package-Layout)&#xa;LscpuProbeAtom               - util-linux lscpu (komplette CPU-Spec)&#xa;SysconfPageSizeProbeAtom     - sysconf(_SC_PAGESIZE) + sysconf(_SC_LEVEL1_DCACHE_LINESIZE)&#xa;LikwidProbeAtom              - LIKWID likwid-topology (HPC-Tool fuer Cache-Topologie)&#xa;ProcMeminfoProbeAtom         - /proc/meminfo (HugePages-Verfuegbarkeit, Memory-Tiers)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g_topo" value="TOPOLOGIE-DISCOVER (Cache + Core + Bus Auto-Discovery)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;DiscoverCacheTopologyAtom    - L1/L2/L3/HBM/V-Cache Hierarchie + Sharing-Domains (Quelle: hwloc + CPUID-Leaf-04)&#xa;DiscoverCoreLayoutAtom       - Anzahl Sockets/CCDs/Cores, P-vs-E-Cores, SMT-Siblings (Quelle: sysfs/hwloc)&#xa;DiscoverIsaFeaturesAtom      - AVX-512/AVX2/SSE/BMI2/NEON/SVE2/RISC-V V-Ext (Quelle: CPUID + cpu_features)&#xa;DiscoverInterconnectAtom     - NUMA-Distance-Matrix, Inter-CCD-Latency (Quelle: hwloc + numactl)&#xa;DiscoverMemoryHierarchyAtom  - DRAM/HBM/NVRAM/CXL Tiers (Quelle: hwloc + dmidecode)&#xa;DiscoverHugePagesAtom        - 2 MiB / 1 GiB Page-Sizes verfuegbar (Quelle: /proc/meminfo + /sys/kernel/mm/hugepages/)&#xa;DiscoverNvramTierAtom         - Persistent Memory Detection (Quelle: ndctl + libpmem)&#xa;DiscoverHbmTierAtom          - HBM-Bandwidth-Tier (Quelle: hwloc-info NUMA-Type=HBM)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="500" width="2320" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g_cpu" value="CPU-FEATURE-DISCOVER (Hardware-Erweiterungen)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;HasAvx512Atom         - AVX-512 inkl. F/CD/ER/PF/BW/DQ/VL Subsets (P02 HOT, P10 SuRF, P32 To-Stride)&#xa;HasAvx2Atom            - AVX2 + FMA (P02 HOT default, P10 Sparse-Filter)&#xa;HasBmi2Atom            - BMI2 PEXT/PDEP fuer HOT Single/Multi-Mask (P02 HOT)&#xa;HasPopcntAtom         - POPCNT fuer rank/select (P09 LOUDS, P10 SuRF, P04 CoCo)&#xa;HasCrc32cAtom         - SSE4.2 CRC32C fuer Hash-Anchors (P07 Wormhole)&#xa;HasSveAtom             - ARM SVE / SVE2 mit dynamischer Vector-Length (P32 To-Stride future)&#xa;HasNeonAtom            - ARM NEON 128-Bit (P10 SuRF, P02 HOT cross-platform)&#xa;HasRiscvVAtom          - RISC-V V-Extension (P32 future, dynamische Vector-Length)&#xa;HasAmxAtom             - Intel AMX (Sapphire Rapids, beobachtbar in Block AO)&#xa;HasIntelThreadDirectorAtom - Intel Thread Director Hint (Block AO i9-14900KS)&#xa;Has3dVCacheAtom       - AMD 3D V-Cache Detection (Block AO Ryzen 9 9950X3D)&#xa;HasHbmAtom              - HBM2/HBM3/LPDDR5X (P25 Mahling, P33 VAMPIR, Grace Hopper)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="800" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hint_paper" value="PAPER-MAPPING (welche Discover-Atoms aus welchen Papern):&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;P05 START: ClflushNodeProbe (gehoert zu K07b Measure), CpuidProbe + DiscoverCacheTopology fuer Cost-Modell&#xa;P13 Hankins/Patel: DiscoverCacheTopology + HasPopcnt fuer Cardenas-Formel&#xa;P15 Graefe Survey: alle Topologie-Atoms (B-Trees-of-Cache-Lines)&#xa;P25 Mahling: DiscoverHbmTier + DiscoverNvramTier fuer Multi-Tier-Allocation&#xa;P28 Kuehn: DiscoverCoreLayout + HasIntelThreadDirector fuer Hot-Path-Layout&#xa;P31 Ungethuem: HasAmx + DiscoverInterconnect fuer iDMA-Detection&#xa;P32 To-Stride: HasAvx512 + HasSve fuer Stride-Pattern-Selection&#xa;P33 VAMPIR: DiscoverHbmTier + DiscoverNvramTier + DiscoverInterconnect&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;OUTPUT: ProbeResults Struct mit allen Discover-Werten -&gt; an K07b MEASURE weitergereicht" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1200" width="2320" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K07b" name="K07b Measure-Phase Atoms">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1700" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K07b KONZEPT - IPlatformProbe MEASURE-Phase (Mikrobenchmark-Atoms)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1A237E;strokeColor=#0D1A66;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Schritt 2 von 5 - Aktive Vermessung der Plattform-Eigenschaften mit Mikrobenchmarks. ALLE Measure-Atoms aus den 33 Papern." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A237E;fontColor=#1A237E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g_lat" value="LATENZ-MESSUNGS-ATOMS (CPU-Cache + Memory-Hierarchie)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;ClflushCycleMeasureAtom        - clflush + rdtsc-Schleife pro Tier-Pair (P05 START)&#xa;CacheLineLatencyAtom           - L1/L2/L3-Hit + Memory-Miss-Latenz in Cycles (P13 Hankins/Patel, P32)&#xa;TlbMissLatencyAtom              - DTLB-Miss + STLB-Miss Cycles (P13 Eq.18, P32 To-Stride)&#xa;BranchMispredictLatencyAtom   - Branch-Mispredict Cycles (Pipeline-Flush-Cost, P13 Eq.16)&#xa;CacheCoherenceCostAtom         - Inter-Socket-Coherence-Cost-Funktion (P28 Block AN, P03 Masstree)&#xa;PointerChasingLatencyAtom     - dependent-load Latenz fuer Pointer-Chasing (P21 Chen, P22 Fractal)&#xa;DDR5RefreshLatencyAtom         - Refresh-Cycle-Effekte (Block AO DDR5-5600, P32)&#xa;NumaLocalRemoteRatioAtom      - local/remote NUMA-Latenz-Verhaeltnis (P25/P29/P32)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g_bw" value="BANDBREITEN-MESSUNGS-ATOMS&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;StreamBenchmarkAtom            - STREAM Triad/Copy/Add/Scale (Memory-Bandwidth, klassisch)&#xa;McCalpinBandwidthAtom          - McCalpin pro NUMA-Node (P25 Mahling Multi-Tier)&#xa;HbmBandwidthAtom               - HBM2/HBM3/LPDDR5X Peak-Bandwidth (P25 Grace, P33 VAMPIR)&#xa;PerInterconnectBandwidthAtom  - CCD-CCD, Core-Cache, Cache-Memory, NUMA, PCIe, NVLink (P31)&#xa;BurstLengthMeasureAtom         - DRAM Burst-Length (P31 Ungethuem)&#xa;MshrCapacityAtom               - Miss-Status-Holding-Register Tiefe (P25 Mahling FB_FULL)&#xa;PrefetcherStreamLimitAtom     - Hardware-Prefetcher Stream-Limit pro Generation (P32)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="460" width="2320" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g_pin" value="PINNING-EFFEKT-MESSUNG (All-Pairs-Pinning Mikrobenchmark)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;AllPairsPinningProbeAtom        - Cross-Core-Latenz vermessen (P25, P32)&#xa;CcdPinningEffectAtom           - CCD-Bound vs CCD-Migrate Performance (Block AO Ryzen 9 9950X3D)&#xa;PEHybridPinningEffectAtom     - P-Core vs E-Core Performance pro Workload (Block AO i9-14900KS)&#xa;HighIpcCorePinningAtom         - Cores mit hoeherem IPC bevorzugen (allgemeine Heuristik)&#xa;LargestL3CcdPinningAtom        - CCD mit groesstem L3 bevorzugen (allgemein, ehemals X3D)&#xa;FirstTouchPolicyMeasureAtom   - Linux first-touch Effekt vermessen (P28 Kuehn)&#xa;SimdThroughputProbeAtom        - SIMD-Throughput pro ISA-Variante (Empfehlung)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="720" width="2320" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g_telemetry" value="TELEMETRY-COUNTER-MESSUNG (Hardware-Performance-Counter Setup)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;PerfmonReaderAtom               - perfmon-Tool-Counter-Reader (P12 CSB+)&#xa;PapiReaderAtom                  - PAPI library counter API (P13 Hankins/Patel)&#xa;VTuneReaderAtom                 - Intel VTune (P28 Kuehn)&#xa;PmuSamplerAtom                  - Linux perf event_open + ring-buffer (alle Tier 3)&#xa;DTLBSTLBCapacityProbeAtom     - DTLB/STLB Capacity-Measurement (P28, P32)&#xa;FbFullCounterMeasureAtom        - L1D_PEND_MISS.FB_FULL (Intel-spezifisch, P25)&#xa;BranchPredictorRateMeasureAtom - Branch-Mispredict-Rate Sampling (implizit P13)&#xa;CacheCoherenceMessageRateAtom - Inter-Socket-Message-Counter (P28 NEU 2026-05-08 Mail)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;OUTPUT: MeasureResults Struct mit allen Cycle-Werten + Bandwidth-Werten + Pinning-Effekten -&gt; an K07c CLASSIFY weitergereicht" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="980" width="2320" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K07c" name="K07c Classify+Publish+PlatformPropertySet">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1700" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K07c KONZEPT - CLASSIFY + PUBLISH + PlatformPropertySet (14+ Properties)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1A237E;strokeColor=#0D1A66;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Schritt 3+4 von 5 - Properties klassifizieren + an Permutations-Module publishen. Alle 14+ Plattform-Properties detailliert." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A237E;fontColor=#1A237E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ippc" value="«concept» IPlatformPropertyClassifier&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ classify(probe : ProbeResults, measure : MeasureResults) : PlatformPropertySet&#xa;+ classify_pressure(snap : PlatformSnapshot) : PressureState  (siehe U09)&#xa;+ negate_negative_recommendations(workload : WorkloadProfile) : NegativeFilterSet (P24)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="props" value="«struct» PlatformPropertySet (14+ Properties REV 5.3 detailliert)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Hardware-Properties (REV 3 + REV 4) ━━━━━━━&#xa;has_asymmetric_l3 : bool                  Discovered (Ryzen 9 9950X3D, ehemals X3DAware)&#xa;has_hybrid_cores : bool                   Discovered (Intel Hybrid, ehemals IntelHybrid)&#xa;has_hbm_tier : bool                       Discovered (Grace Hopper, A64FX)&#xa;preferred_pinning : PinningPolicy         Gemessen (LARGEST_L3_CCD / HIGH_IPC_CORES / NUMA_LOCAL / ROUND_ROBIN)&#xa;usable_simd_width : int                   Gemessen (128 SSE / 256 AVX2 / 512 AVX-512 / SVE-Length)&#xa;has_software_prefetch : bool              Gemessen (PREFETCHT0 verfuegbar + effektiv)&#xa;coherence_cost_threshold : double         Gemessen (P28 Block AN)&#xa;━━━━━━━ NEUE Properties REV 5 ━━━━━━━&#xa;branch_predictor : BranchPredictorModel   Gemessen (24-Cycle vs 14-Cycle Mispredict-Cost)&#xa;has_bmi2_pext_pdep : bool                Discovered (BMI2 PEXT/PDEP fuer HOT P02)&#xa;primary_storage : StorageMediumKind       Discovered (DRAM/NVRAM)&#xa;page_cache_model : PageCacheModel         Discovered (OS-Page-Cache vs App-Cache, P10 SuRF)&#xa;memory_channels : int                     Discovered (DDR5-Bandwidth-Modell, Block AO)&#xa;has_3d_v_cache : bool                     Discovered (Block AO Ryzen 9 9950X3D)&#xa;has_intel_thread_director : bool          Discovered (Block AO i9-14900KS)&#xa;━━━━━━━ NEUE Properties REV 5.3 ━━━━━━━&#xa;tlb_capacity : TlbCapacity (DTLB/STLB)    Gemessen (P28, P32)&#xa;mshr_depth : int                          Gemessen (Mahling P25 FB_FULL)&#xa;dram_burst_length : int                  Discovered (P31 Ungethuem)&#xa;has_amx : bool                            Discovered (Intel AMX, beobachtbar)&#xa;has_riscv_vector : bool                   Discovered (RISC-V V-Ext, future)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="340" width="2320" height="640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iceop" value="«concept» ICacheEngineOptionPublisher (Schritt 4 PUBLISH)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- properties_ : PlatformPropertySet&#xa;- registered_modules_ : vector&lt;PermutationModule*&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ register_module(module : PermutationModule&amp;) : void&#xa;+ unregister_module(module) : void&#xa;+ publish_options_to_all() : void&#xa;+ filter_options_for(module) : OptionSet      (compile-time-gefiltert via Concepts)&#xa;+ properties() const : PlatformPropertySet const&amp;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Mechanik ━━━━━━━&#xa;Jede Permutation erhaelt nur die Optionen, die ihre Bausteine konsumieren koennen.&#xa;C++23 requires-Klausel filtert Konkretisierungen, die inkompatible Properties haben.&#xa;Beispiel: HOT-Multi-Mask braucht has_avx2=true UND has_bmi2_pext_pdep=true." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1000" width="2320" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hint" value="REV 5.3 NEUE PROPERTIES (5 zusaetzlich): tlb_capacity, mshr_depth, dram_burst_length, has_amx, has_riscv_vector. Vermessen in K07b, klassifiziert hier in K07c, publiziert an Permutations-Module via ICacheEngineOptionPublisher." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1300" width="2320" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K07d" name="K07d 28 Saeule-B-Concepts detailliert">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1700" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1900" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K07d KONZEPT - 28 NEUE Saeule-B-Concept-Klassen mit Methoden (Detail aus REV 5.1)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1A237E;strokeColor=#0D1A66;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Vollstaendige Concept-Definitionen aller 28 fehlenden Saeule-B-Klassen (war nur als Liste in K07; jetzt mit Methoden + Konkretisierungen)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A237E;fontColor=#1A237E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="grp1" value="Hardware-Probing + Memory-Hierarchie Concepts&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;1.  «concept» IRankSelectPrimitive  -  popcount/Jacobson-Two-Level/Poppy (P09/P10/P04)&#xa;     + rank(pos) const : size_t   + select(idx) const : size_t   + popcount(range) const : size_t&#xa;2.  «concept» IModelAcquisitionStrategy  -  wie wird ILivePlatformModel gewonnen? (P05)&#xa;     + acquire() : ILivePlatformModel   + refresh_period() const : milliseconds   + cost_estimate() const : Cycles&#xa;3.  «concept» IVirtualMemoryStrategy  -  DirectMapping/RewiredSharedPages/HugePages (P05 START)&#xa;     + map(virtual_addr, physical_addr) : void   + remap(virt, new_phys) : void   + supports_huge_pages() const : bool&#xa;4.  «concept» IBranchPredictorModel  -  Mispredict-Cost als Plattform-Kennzahl (P01/P13)&#xa;     + mispredict_cycles() const : int   + predict_taken(branch_addr) const : bool&#xa;5.  «concept» IBitManipulationFeatureGate  -  BMI2 PEXT/PDEP/popcount + Fallback (P02 HOT)&#xa;     + has_pext() const : bool   + has_pdep() const : bool   + fallback_pext(mask, val) : Bits&#xa;6.  «concept» IStorageMedium  -  DRAM/NVRAM/SSD/HDD-Hierarchy (P10 SuRF, P22 Fractal)&#xa;     + tier_kind() const : StorageMediumKind   + latency_class() const : LatencyClass   + persistence() const : bool&#xa;7.  «concept» IPageCacheModel  -  OS Page Cache + App Block Cache 2-stufig (P10 SuRF)&#xa;     + os_cache_size() const : size_t   + app_cache_size() const : size_t   + hit_ratio() const : double" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="grp2" value="Concurrency + Scheduling + Workload Concepts&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;8.  «concept» IConcurrencyProtocol  -  eigene Saeule C, orthogonal A/B (P02/P03/P08/P29/P30)&#xa;     + protocol_kind() const : ProtocolKind   + acquire(node) : Token   + release(token) : void   + reclaim(node) : void&#xa;9.  «concept» IRebuildScheduler  -  VACUUM-aehnliche Trigger (P05 START Self-Tuning)&#xa;     + schedule_rebuild(criteria : RebuildCriteria) : Handle   + on_threshold_reached(thresh) : void   + abort(handle) : void&#xa;10. «concept» IRebuildCostModel  -  Bauzeit O(N h^2) bei P04 CoCo&#xa;     + estimate_rebuild_cost(workload) : Cost   + worth_rebuilding(workload) const : bool&#xa;11. «concept» IWorkloadModel  -  Read-Only/Read-Mostly/Write-Heavy/Mixed/Skewed (P05 future)&#xa;     + workload_kind() const : WorkloadKind   + read_write_ratio() const : double   + skew_factor() const : double&#xa;12. «concept» ICellProbeModel vs IWordProbeModel  -  2 alternative Plattform-Modelle (P09 Jacobson)&#xa;     + cell_size() const : size_t   + word_size() const : size_t&#xa;13. «concept» IPositionalCorrespondencePrefetch  -  Prefetch via Layout-Invariante (P10 SuRF)&#xa;     + position_for(child_idx, parent_pos) : Position   + emit_prefetch(positions) : void&#xa;14. «concept» ICacheConflictModel  -  FullAssociative vs SetAssociative (P18 Saikkonen)&#xa;     + associativity() const : int   + set_count() const : int   + conflict_probability(addr_a, addr_b) : double" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="560" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="grp3" value="ISA-Features + Compute-Offload + Memory-Decorator Concepts&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;15. «concept» ITemporalCacheStrategy  -  Instruction-Cache, P15 Sektion 7&#xa;     + has_separate_icache() const : bool   + icache_size() const : size_t   + prefetch_instruction(addr) : void&#xa;16. «concept» IIntelligentDMA  -  Configurator/AGU/DataFetcher/Crawler (P31 iDMA)&#xa;     + configure(transfer_spec) : Handle   + start(handle) : void   + wait(handle) : void&#xa;17. «concept» IComputeOffload  -  PE/iDMA/App-Core/FPGA (P31)&#xa;     + offload_target() const : OffloadTarget   + submit(operation) : Future   + cost(operation) : Cycles&#xa;18. «concept» IHardwareExtension Sub-Hierarchie  -  WAH/PLWAH/COMPAX, Hash-Lookup, MergeSort (P31 TUD)&#xa;     + extension_kind() const : ExtensionKind   + apply(operation, data) : Result   + cost_model() const : CostModel&#xa;19. «concept» IMemoryDecorator (NFP)  -  latency/throughput/transience/reliability/wearout (P33 VAMPIR)&#xa;     + nfp_properties() const : NfpPropertySet   + decorate(allocation) : DecoratedAllocation&#xa;20. «concept» IHeterogeneousAllocator (V-malloc)  -  heterogene Memory-Auswahl (P33)&#xa;     + allocate(size, nfp_hint : NfpHint) : void*   + select_tier(nfp_hint) : TierKind&#xa;21. «concept» IMigrationPolicy  -  transparente Migration zwischen Tiers (P33 Compensation)&#xa;     + should_migrate(page, target_tier) const : bool   + migrate(page, target_tier) : void" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="960" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="grp4" value="Pipeline + Encoding + Topologie Concepts&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;22. «concept» ICompileTimeNegotiator  -  Multi-Query Compile-Time-Negotiation (P33)&#xa;     + negotiate(queries : list&lt;Query&gt;) : NegotiationResult   + select_best_combo() : Combo&#xa;23. «concept» IPipelineScheduler  -  Operation-Pipelines mit Memory-Awareness (P33)&#xa;     + schedule(pipeline : Pipeline) : Schedule   + memory_aware_reorder(ops) : list&lt;Op&gt;&#xa;24. «concept» IAccessPatternStrategy  -  sequential/strided/simd (P32 To-Stride)&#xa;     + pattern_kind() const : AccessPatternKind   + recommend_layout(workload) : LayoutHint&#xa;25. «concept» IPaddingStrategy  -  576-Byte-Padding fuer Cache-Set-Disalignment (P32)&#xa;     + padding_size_bytes() const : size_t   + apply_padding(allocation) : Allocation&#xa;26. «concept» IInformationTheoreticLowerBound  -  Optimality-Marker fuer Encoding (P09)&#xa;     + lower_bound_bits(structure) const : size_t   + actual_bits(structure) const : size_t   + efficiency() const : double&#xa;27. «concept» IPositionalAddressing  -  Implicit Addressing via Position-in-Bitstring (P09)&#xa;     + position_to_address(pos) const : address_t   + address_to_position(addr) const : size_t&#xa;28. «concept» ITopologyEncoding  -  LOUDS/DFUDS/BP/Pointer/BitArray (orthogonal zu IFanout)&#xa;     + encoding_kind() const : TopologyEncodingKind   + encode(tree) : EncodedTree   + decode(encoded) : Tree" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#4A148C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1360" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K08a" name="K08a Cache-Hierarchie Detail">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K08a KONZEPT - Cache-Hierarchie Detail (ICacheLevel + ICacheLine + ICacheTopology + ICacheResidency)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#01579B;strokeColor=#003C71;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Sub-Split aus K08 Plattform-Modell - Vollstaendige Cache-Hierarchie + 33-Paper-Verfeinerungen (NUMA / TLB / NVRAM / Energy)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#01579B;fontColor=#01579B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iclevel" value="«concept» ICacheLevel&lt;L&gt; (vollstaendig)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ tier_kind : enum L1 / L2 / L3 / HBM / V_CACHE / DRAM / NVRAM / SSD&#xa;+ size_bytes : size_t&#xa;+ line_size_bytes : size_t (typ. 64, 256 ARM A64FX, 128 Apple Silicon)&#xa;+ associativity : int (z.B. 8/16/64)&#xa;+ ways : int&#xa;+ sets : int&#xa;+ latency_cycles : double (Hit-Latenz)&#xa;+ bandwidth_gbps : double&#xa;+ inclusive : bool (inclusive vs exclusive cache)&#xa;+ shared_cores : vector&lt;CoreId&gt; (welche Cores teilen)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ effective_capacity() : size_t&#xa;+ measured_at(timestamp) : MeasureSnapshot&#xa;+ refresh_latency() const : RefreshCycle  (NEU REV 5.3 - DDR5 Refresh-Cycle)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="icline" value="«concept» ICacheLine&lt;CL&gt; (Hardware-Atomic-Transfer)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ size : size_t (PLATTFORM-SPEZIFISCH, NIE hardcoded!)&#xa;+ state : enum MESI / MOESI&#xa;+ residency : ICacheLevel const&amp;&#xa;+ tag : address_t&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ size_bytes() const noexcept : size_t&#xa;+ contains(addr : address_t) const noexcept : bool&#xa;━━━━━━━ C++17 Plattform-Abstraktion ━━━━━━━&#xa;static constexpr size_t destructive_size = std::hardware_destructive_interference_size;&#xa;static constexpr size_t constructive_size = std::hardware_constructive_interference_size;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Plattform-Werte (Stand 2026) ━━━━━━━&#xa;x86-64 (Intel/AMD): 64 B&#xa;ARM Cortex-A: 64 B&#xa;Apple Silicon (M1-M4): 128 B (P-Cores)&#xa;Fujitsu A64FX (Fugaku): 256 B (4-way associativ)&#xa;IBM POWER9/POWER10: 128 B (sektoriert)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="160" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ictopo" value="«concept» ICacheTopology&lt;CT&gt; (Hierarchie + asymmetric_l3 + per_ccd Map)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- levels_ : vector&lt;ICacheLevel&amp;&gt; (in Hierarchie-Reihenfolge L1-L2-L3-HBM-V_CACHE)&#xa;- per_ccd_ : map&lt;CcdId, ICacheLevel&amp;&gt; (Block AO Ryzen 9 9950X3D)&#xa;- asymmetric_l3_ : bool (Auto-discovered)&#xa;- l3_per_ccd : map&lt;CcdId, size_t&gt; (96+32 MiB bei Ryzen 9 9950X3D)&#xa;- numa_local_remote_ratio : double (NEU REV 5.3 - cross-socket cost)&#xa;- has_3d_v_cache : bool (NEU REV 5.3 - Block AO)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ levels() const : span&lt;ICacheLevel const&amp;&gt;&#xa;+ level_count() const noexcept : size_t&#xa;+ has_asymmetric_l3() const noexcept : bool&#xa;+ largest_l3_ccd() const : optional&lt;CcdId&gt;&#xa;+ tier_for(ptr : void*) : optional&lt;TierKind&gt;&#xa;+ cross_ccd_latency(src, dst) const : Cycles  (NEU REV 5.3)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="560" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="icres" value="«concept» ICacheResidency&lt;CR&gt; (Cache whereabouts)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- residency_map_ : map&lt;ICachePage*, ResidencyKind&gt;&#xa;- access_history_ : RingBuffer&lt;AccessRecord&gt; (NEU REV 5.3 - fuer Hot-Path-Detection)&#xa;- eviction_log_ : RingBuffer&lt;EvictionRecord&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ residency_of(page : ICachePage&amp;) : ResidencyKind&#xa;+ track_access(page : ICachePage&amp;) : void&#xa;+ track_eviction(page : ICachePage&amp;) : void&#xa;+ pinning_hint_for(page : ICachePage&amp;) : optional&lt;TierKind&gt;&#xa;+ snapshot() : ResidencyMap&#xa;+ hot_pages() const : vector&lt;ICachePage*&gt; (NEU REV 5.3 P28 Hot-Path)&#xa;━━━━━━━ ResidencyKind enum ━━━━━━━&#xa;Cached | HeaderCached | Uncached | Evicted | Pinned | Migrated" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="560" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="paper_verf" value="33-PAPER-VERFEINERUNGEN fuer Cache-Hierarchie (REV 5.1+5.3 Adapter)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;P05 START: ClflushNodeProbe + LatencyProbe -&gt; ICacheLevel.latency_cycles + cache_topology Discovery&#xa;P10 SuRF: 2-stufige PageCacheModel (OS + App) -&gt; IPageCacheModel orthogonal&#xa;P13 Hankins/Patel: TLB-Aware-Sizing -&gt; ITlbModel als eigenes Concept (NEU REV 5)&#xa;P22 Chen Fractal: Multi-Tier-Cache-Disk -&gt; ICacheTopology mit DRAM+SSD/HDD-Tier-Kind&#xa;P25 Mahling: HBM2/HBM3/LPDDR5X-Tier + MSHR-Pressure -&gt; ICacheLevel.tier_kind=HBM + mshr_depth&#xa;P28 Kuehn Block AN: Cache-Coherence-Cost-Probe -&gt; ICacheTopology.cross_ccd_latency&#xa;P29 RCU: 6-Flavor-RCU (qsbr/mb/membarrier/signal) statt 4 -&gt; IConcurrencyProtocol-Sub-Hierarchie&#xa;P31 Ungethuem: iDMA-Configurator -&gt; IIntelligentDMA als eigenes Concept&#xa;P32 To-Stride: DTLB/STLB-Capacity-Probe -&gt; ITlbModel.dtlb_size + stlb_size&#xa;P33 VAMPIR: NFP-Decorator (latency/throughput/transience) -&gt; IMemoryDecorator als orthogonales Concept&#xa;Block AO Ryzen 9 9950X3D: has_3d_v_cache + asymmetric_l3_per_ccd&#xa;Block AO i9-14900KS: hybrid_cores + IntelThreadDirector + memory_channels DDR5-5600" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="960" width="2320" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K08b" name="K08b CPU-Modell + Pinning + NUMA">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K08b KONZEPT - CPU-Modell + Pinning + NUMA Detail (Sub-Split aus K08)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#01579B;strokeColor=#003C71;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Generisches CPU-Modell ohne CPU-Spezialisierung + 33-Paper-NUMA-Verfeinerungen + 6-Flavor-RCU-Klassifikation" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#01579B;fontColor=#01579B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="icpu" value="«concept» ICpuCore&lt;C&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ core_id : CoreId&#xa;+ core_class : enum P_CORE / E_CORE / CCD0_HIGH_L3 / CCD1_LOW_L3 / ARM_A78 / ARM_A55 / RISCV / ...&#xa;+ assigned_caches : vector&lt;ICacheLevel*&gt; (welche Cache-Ebenen sieht der Kern?)&#xa;+ hyperthreading : optional&lt;HtSibling&gt;&#xa;+ ipc_class : double (NEU REV 5.3 - gemessen IPC pro Core-Typ)&#xa;+ frequency_max : Hz (NEU REV 5.3 - max Boost-Frequency)&#xa;+ thread_director_hint : Optional&lt;PerformanceClass&gt; (NEU REV 5.3 - Intel Hybrid)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ caches() const : span&lt;ICacheLevel const&amp;&gt;&#xa;+ has_smt() const noexcept : bool&#xa;+ ipc_class() const noexcept : double" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iclayout" value="«concept» ICoreLayout&lt;CL&gt; (Topologie ohne CPU-Namen)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- cores_ : vector&lt;ICpuCore&amp;&gt;&#xa;- p_core_count : int   (Block AO i9 8 P-Cores)&#xa;- e_core_count : int   (Block AO i9 16 E-Cores)&#xa;- ccd_count : int      (Block AO Ryzen 9 9950X3D 2 CCDs)&#xa;- socket_count : int   (Multi-Socket)&#xa;- numa_node_count : int&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ cores() const : span&lt;ICpuCore const&amp;&gt;&#xa;+ is_hybrid() const noexcept : bool&#xa;+ has_asymmetric_l3() const noexcept : bool&#xa;+ p_cores() const : vector&lt;ICpuCore*&gt;&#xa;+ e_cores() const : vector&lt;ICpuCore*&gt;&#xa;+ cores_per_ccd(ccd : CcdId) const : vector&lt;ICpuCore*&gt;&#xa;+ cores_per_numa(node : NumaNode) const : vector&lt;ICpuCore*&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="160" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ictm" value="«concept» ICoreToThreadMap&lt;CTM&gt; (Mapping Threads -&gt; Kerne)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- pinning_policy_ : IPinningPolicy&amp;&#xa;- current_assignment_ : map&lt;thread::id, CoreId&gt;&#xa;- rebalance_trigger_ : ConsolidationBarrierEvent&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ pin_thread(tid : thread::id, core : CoreId) : void&#xa;+ unpin_thread(tid : thread::id) : void&#xa;+ rebalance() : void&#xa;+ assignment_for(tid : thread::id) const : optional&lt;CoreId&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="500" width="1140" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ipin" value="«concept» IPinningPolicy&lt;P&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ policy_kind : enum LARGEST_L3_CCD / HIGH_IPC_CORES / NUMA_LOCAL / ROUND_ROBIN / FIRST_TOUCH / NUMACTL_BIND / CROSS_SOCKET_AVOID / PER_CCD_LOCKING&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ pin(thread, layout : ICoreLayout const&amp;) : CoreId&#xa;+ rebalance(load : map&lt;CoreId, double&gt;) : Reassignment&#xa;━━━━━━━ Konkretisierungen (NEU REV 5.3 - aus 33 Papern) ━━━━━━━&#xa;LargestL3CcdPinningPolicy (allgemein, ehemals X3DAware)&#xa;HotPathOnHighIpcCorePolicy (allgemein, ehemals IntelHybrid)&#xa;NumaLocalPolicy (P25 Mahling)&#xa;FirstTouchPolicy (P28 Kuehn)&#xa;NumactlBindPolicy (P25/P32)&#xa;CrossSocketAvoidancePolicy (P03 Masstree)&#xa;PerCcdLockingPolicy (allgemein)&#xa;IntelThreadDirectorHintPolicy (Block AO i9-14900KS)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="500" width="1140" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="numa_verf" value="NUMA + CONCURRENCY VERFEINERUNGEN REV 5.3 (33-Paper-Code-Adapter)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;NUMA (vorher schwach modelliert, jetzt durchgaengig):&#xa;- Cross-Socket-cost in IPinningPolicy (P25 Mahling)&#xa;- NUMA-node-binding via NumactlBindPolicy (P32 To-Stride)&#xa;- First-touch-policy als Default (P28 Kuehn)&#xa;- numa_local_remote_ratio in ICacheTopology (NEU)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;6-Flavor-RCU-Klassifikation (statt nur 4 in P29):&#xa;- qsbr-RCU (Quiescent State Based, P07 Wormhole)&#xa;- mb-RCU (Memory Barrier-based)&#xa;- membarrier-RCU (sys_membarrier-based)&#xa;- signal-RCU (signal-based)&#xa;- preempt-RCU (preemptable, kernel-only)&#xa;- tasks-RCU (kernel tasks)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Alle als IConcurrencyProtocol-Konkretisierungen (siehe K07d Concept #8)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="840" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K08c" name="K08c Bus + ISA + Hardware-Extensions">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K08c KONZEPT - Bus + ISA + Hardware-Extensions Detail" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#01579B;strokeColor=#003C71;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Inter-Component-Communication + ISA-Feature-Set + Hardware-Erweiterungen + ITlbModel (NEU REV 5)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#01579B;fontColor=#01579B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iic" value="«concept» IInterconnect&lt;IC&gt; (Verbindung zwischen Komponenten)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ source : Node*  (CCD/Core/Cache/MemController)&#xa;+ target : Node*&#xa;+ bandwidth_gbps : double&#xa;+ latency_ns : double&#xa;+ link_class : enum INTRA_CCD / INTER_CCD / MEMORY_BUS / NUMA_LINK / PCIE / NVLINK / CXL / INFINITY_FABRIC / RING_BUS / MESH&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ effective_bandwidth() const : double&#xa;+ is_saturated() const noexcept : bool" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="1140" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibt" value="«concept» IBusTopology&lt;BT&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- interconnects_ : vector&lt;IInterconnect&amp;&gt;&#xa;- inter_chiplet_links : map&lt;CcdPair, IInterconnect*&gt;  (Block AO Ryzen Infinity Fabric)&#xa;- intra_cluster_links : map&lt;CorePair, IInterconnect*&gt; (Block AO i9 Ring-Bus)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ link_between(src : Node*, dst : Node*) : optional&lt;IInterconnect*&gt;&#xa;+ shortest_path(src, dst) : vector&lt;IInterconnect*&gt;&#xa;+ bottleneck_link() const : optional&lt;IInterconnect*&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="160" width="1140" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="imbm" value="«concept» IMemoryBandwidthModel&lt;MBM&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- per_link_capacity : map&lt;IInterconnect*, double&gt;&#xa;- current_utilization : map&lt;IInterconnect*, double&gt; (Live-Messung via perf)&#xa;- bottleneck_detection : function&lt;Bottleneck()&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ utilization_of(link : IInterconnect&amp;) const : double&#xa;+ saturation_threshold() const : double&#xa;+ detect_bottleneck() : optional&lt;Bottleneck&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="420" width="1140" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="itlb" value="«concept» ITlbModel (NEU REV 5)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ dtlb_size : int (Data-TLB Eintraege, P28/P32)&#xa;+ stlb_size : int (Second-Level-TLB)&#xa;+ dtlb_associativity : int&#xa;+ has_huge_page_tlb : bool (2 MiB / 1 GiB)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ effective_capacity() : int&#xa;+ miss_cost_cycles() const : int&#xa;━━━━━━━ Belegpapiere ━━━━━━━&#xa;P13 Hankins/Patel: TLB-Aware-Sizing&#xa;P28 Kuehn: TLB-Druck als Hot-Path-Faktor&#xa;P32 To-Stride: DTLB/STLB-Capacity-Probe (Mikrobenchmark)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="420" width="1140" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ihx" value="«concept» IHardwareExtension&lt;HX&gt; (eine ISA-Feature-Bank)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ feature_name : string  (z.B. AVX-512, BMI2, NEON, SVE2)&#xa;+ bit_position : int  (in IsaFlagBank, F10-K)&#xa;+ cost_model : map&lt;Operation, Cycles&gt;&#xa;+ dependent_features : vector&lt;HardwareExtension*&gt;&#xa;+ vendor : enum INTEL / AMD / ARM / RISCV / IBM / FUJITSU&#xa;━━━━━━━ NEU REV 5.3 Sub-Hierarchie aus P31 Ungethuem TUD ━━━━━━━&#xa;BitmapCompressionExt: WAH / PLWAH / COMPAX&#xa;HashLookupExt: Hash / Lookup / Insert / CityHash32 / Sampling&#xa;MergeSortExt: MergeSort / Intersection / Union / Difference / SortMergeJoin / SortMergeAggregation&#xa;RiscBaseISA-Sub: RV64I / RV64M / RV64C / RV64F&#xa;SIMD-Sub: SSE / SSE2 / SSE3 / SSSE3 / SSE4.1 / SSE4.2 / AVX / AVX2 / AVX-512&#xa;ARM-Sub: NEON / SVE / SVE2 / Crypto / SHA / FP16&#xa;Spezial: SGX / THUMB / AMX / MMX" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="680" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iisa" value="«concept» IIsaFeatureSet&lt;IFS&gt; (gesamte ISA-Feature-Verfuegbarkeit)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- extensions_ : vector&lt;IHardwareExtension&amp;&gt;&#xa;- x86_features : SseAvxBmiSet&#xa;- arm_features : NeonSveSet&#xa;- riscv_features : RiscVVSet&#xa;- discovered_at : timestamp&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ has_extension(name : string) const : bool&#xa;+ has_avx512() const noexcept : bool&#xa;+ has_bmi2() const noexcept : bool&#xa;+ has_neon() const noexcept : bool&#xa;+ has_sve(width : int) const : bool&#xa;+ best_simd_width_for(workload : WorkloadKind) const : int&#xa;━━━━━━━ Live-Wartung ━━━━━━━&#xa;Wird bei jedem CacheEngine-Snapshot abgefragt (~100 ms-Tick).&#xa;Compile-Time-Filter via C++23 requires-Klausel (z.B. requires HotInterpreter has_avx2 + has_bmi2)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="680" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hint_isa" value="ISA-FEATURE-MAPPING auf 33 Paper:&#xa;P02 HOT: BMI2 PEXT/PDEP + AVX2 (Single/Multi-Mask), Fallback fuer non-BMI2&#xa;P10 SuRF: SSE 128-Bit Sparse-Filter, AVX-512 fuer Dense-Filter&#xa;P14 Itanium: lfetch.nt1 (Itanium-spezifisch, Legacy)&#xa;P25 Mahling: ARM NEON KEEP/STREAM Targets, Coroutine-Variante mit weak/strong Reliability auf A64FX&#xa;P31 Ungethuem TUD: WAH/PLWAH/COMPAX Bitmap-Compression, Hash-Lookup, MergeSort auf Tomahawk-PE&#xa;P32 To-Stride TUD: AVX-512 + SVE Strided-Pattern, ohne ISA-Feature-Gate scheitert auf 30-42 Partitions" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1080" width="2320" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K08d" name="K08d Live-Modell + Block AO + Adapter">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K08d KONZEPT - Live-Modell + Block AO Production-Plattform + Plattform-Adapter (5 OFFEN-Punkte)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#01579B;strokeColor=#003C71;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Echtzeit-Modell + 5 OFFEN-Punkte aus 13_md §10.5 Block AO + ICacheStrategy-Adapter" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#01579B;fontColor=#01579B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ilpm" value="«concept» ILivePlatformModel&lt;LPM&gt; (Echzeit-Modell)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Komposition ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ cache_topology : ICacheTopology&#xa;+ cache_residency : ICacheResidency  (waehrend Lookup-Workload aktualisiert)&#xa;+ core_layout : ICoreLayout&#xa;+ core_thread_map : ICoreToThreadMap&#xa;+ isa_features : IIsaFeatureSet&#xa;+ bus_topology : IBusTopology&#xa;+ bandwidth_model : IMemoryBandwidthModel&#xa;+ tlb_model : ITlbModel  (NEU REV 5)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- update_period : milliseconds  (z.B. 100 ms-Tick)&#xa;- update_source : enum PERF_COUNTER / SYSFS / CPUID / PAPI / VTUNE&#xa;- snapshot_history : RingBuffer&lt;PlatformSnapshot&gt; (NEU REV 5.3 fuer Trend-Analyse)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ refresh() : void&#xa;+ snapshot() const : PlatformSnapshot&#xa;+ pressure_state() const : PressureState  (siehe U09 State-Pattern)&#xa;+ subscribe(observer) : Token" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8EAF6;strokeColor=#1A237E;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ilcm" value="«concept» ILiveCpuModel&lt;LCM&gt; (Live-Sicht auf Per-Core-Lasten)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- per_core_utilization : map&lt;CoreId, double&gt;&#xa;- per_core_cache_pressure : map&lt;CoreId, double&gt;&#xa;- per_core_hot_path_score : map&lt;CoreId, double&gt;&#xa;- per_core_ipc : map&lt;CoreId, double&gt;  (NEU REV 5.3)&#xa;- per_core_branch_mispredict_rate : map&lt;CoreId, double&gt;  (NEU REV 5.3)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden (public) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ utilization_of(core) const : double&#xa;+ hot_path_cores() const : vector&lt;CoreId&gt;  (Top-N nach hot_path_score)&#xa;+ idle_cores() const : vector&lt;CoreId&gt;  (utilization &lt; threshold)&#xa;+ saturated_cores() const : vector&lt;CoreId&gt;  (utilization &gt; threshold)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8EAF6;strokeColor=#1A237E;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="160" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="block_ao" value="BLOCK AO PRODUCTION-PLATTFORM (5 OFFEN-Punkte aus 13_md §10.5)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;42. Cache-Coherence-Pressure-Quantifizierung 3D V-Cache (Ryzen 9 9950X3D)&#xa;     - keines der 33 Paper modelliert 3D-stacked Cache&#xa;     - LOESUNG REV 5.3: ICacheTopology.has_3d_v_cache + cross_ccd_latency() + asymmetric_l3_per_ccd&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;43. P/E-Core-Heterogenitaet i9-14900KS (Hybrid-Architecture)&#xa;     - keines der 33 Paper modelliert Hybrid-Architecture&#xa;     - LOESUNG REV 5.3: ICpuCore.thread_director_hint + ICoreLayout.is_hybrid() + IPinningPolicy::HotPathOnHighIpcCorePolicy&#xa;     - IntelThreadDirector-Integration ist Eigenleistung&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;44. Bandwidth-Aware Layout fuer DDR5-5600 (Multi-Channel + Refresh-Cycle)&#xa;     - P31 DDR2 / P32 DDR4/5 nur implizit&#xa;     - LOESUNG REV 5.3: ICacheLevel.refresh_latency() + memory_channels in PlatformPropertySet&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;45. Live-Probing der Plattform-Konstanten via CPUID + __cpu_indicator_init&#xa;     - kein Paper liefert Code-Template&#xa;     - LOESUNG REV 5.3: CpuidProbeAtom + ProcCpuinfoProbeAtom in K07a&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;46. Cross-CCX-Coherence-Latenz Ryzen 9 9950X3D&#xa;     - nicht in 33 Papern modelliert&#xa;     - LOESUNG REV 5.3: ICacheTopology.cross_ccd_latency(src, dst) + AllPairsPinningProbeAtom in K07b" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="560" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="adapter" value="ICACHESTRATEGY-ADAPTER (wie ICacheEngine die Live-Daten an ICacheStrategy zurueckgibt)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;CacheEngineStrategy konsumiert ILivePlatformModel via Visitor-Pattern (siehe U09):&#xa;1. ICacheStrategy.visit(read_op) -&gt; ruft engine.advise(RequestContext)&#xa;2. ICacheEngine.snapshot() liefert PlatformSnapshot mit Live-Werten&#xa;3. ICacheEngine klassifiziert PressureState (Idle/Warmup/Saturated/CoherenceStorm/Recovery)&#xa;4. Pipeline ueber 12 Sub-Engines C1-C12 liefert konsolidierte CacheRecommendation&#xa;5. CacheRecommendation enthaelt:&#xa;   - alloc_hint (Tier-Wahl basierend auf has_hbm_tier + bandwidth_model.bottleneck)&#xa;   - prefetch_advice (Distance basierend auf cache_topology.latency + tlb_capacity)&#xa;   - layout_proposal (Knoten-Geometrie basierend auf cache_line_size + has_3d_v_cache)&#xa;   - migration_directive (Tier-Wechsel basierend auf hot_path_cores + residency snapshot)&#xa;   - pinning_directive (Core-Bindung basierend auf preferred_pinning + hybrid_cores)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Wirkung: ICacheStrategy ist plattform-agnostisch im Code, plattform-konkret im Verhalten ueber das Live-Modell." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="960" width="2320" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K05b" name="K05b PRT-ART 2 Node-Typen + 4 Suchtypen">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1700" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1700" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K05b KONZEPT (REV 6 ANHANG) - PRT-ART-spezifische Node-Typen (ERGAENZT die 6 universellen Seitentypen aus §5.3)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1B5E20;strokeColor=#0D3F11;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="WICHTIG: Die 6 universellen Seitentypen aus K05/§5.3 (Termin 4 Scope-Freeze) BLEIBEN permutierbar. PRT-ART liefert NUR ZUSAETZLICH 2 spezifische Node-Typen + 4 interne Suchtypen als experimentelle Variante." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;fontColor=#E65100;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="root" value="«concept» IPrtArtNode (Wurzel der PRT-ART-eigenen Knotenfamilie)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=14;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="160" width="800" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="redirect" value="PrtArtRedirectNode (CoCo-Idee uebernommen)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Kompaktiert eindeutige Substrings&#xa;Vermeidet Pointer-Chasing&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- compressed_bytes : vector&lt;byte&gt;&#xa;- value_handle : optional&lt;ValueHandle&lt;Value&gt;&gt;  (terminal, Fall 3)&#xa;- next_node : optional&lt;IPrtArtNode*&gt;  (Sub-B+-Node oder weitere Redirect)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ match_prefix(key : KeyView) : MatchResult  (byte-by-byte)&#xa;+ is_terminal() const noexcept : bool&#xa;━━━━━━━ Fall 3 (GPT): nur &#39;haus&#39; gespeichert&#xa;Root = PrtArtRedirectNode(&#39;haus&#39;) + ValueHandle&#xa;Lookup &#39;hafen&#39; = match &#39;ha&#39; ok, &#39;u&#39; != &#39;f&#39; -&gt; empty Value/Exception" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="320" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bplus" value="PrtArtBPlusNode (ART-Idee verallgemeinert)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Enthaelt EINEN von 4 internen Suchtypen&#xa;Dynamische Layout-Transition bei Dichte 25/50/75%&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- current_search_type : SearchTypeKind&#xa;- search_type_data : variant&lt;TypeA, TypeB, TypeC, TypeD&gt;&#xa;- density : double (0.0..1.0)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ lookup(byte : uint8_t) : LookupResult&#xa;+ insert(byte, next_node) : InsertResult&#xa;+ density() const noexcept : double&#xa;+ transition_if_threshold_reached() : TransitionResult&#xa;━━━━━━━ Forschungsfrage (Frage 4 GPT):&#xa;Welche Reihenfolge der 4 Methoden ist optimal?&#xa;-&gt; Permutationsdimension D10 in K12 NEU REV 6" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="320" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="types" value="4 INTERNE SUCHTYPEN (NEU REV 6 aus Frage 4)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Typ A: Array[256]                  - 1 Byte Slot, 256 Felder. Initial. -&gt; B bei &gt; 25 Prozent Dichte (Merge 2 Ebenen)&#xa;Typ B: Array[65535]                - 2 Byte Slot, 65535 Felder. -&gt; C bei &gt; 50 Prozent Dichte (Split 2 Ebenen, Auftrittswahrscheinlichkeit-Sortierung)&#xa;Typ C: Vector&lt;tuple&lt;u8,u8&gt;&gt; Range Scan, sortiert nach Auftrittswahrscheinlichkeit - 2 Byte Pair. -&gt; D bei &gt; 75 Prozent Dichte (Merge 2 Ebenen)&#xa;Typ D: Vector&lt;tuple&lt;u16,u16&gt;&gt; Range Scan, sortiert nach Auftrittswahrscheinlichkeit - 4 Byte Pair, terminale dichteste Form" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="720" width="2320" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="trans" value="DICHTE-SCHWELLEN-TRANSITION (Frage 4 GPT)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;25% Schwelle: Typ A -&gt; Typ B   (Punkt-Suche mit 1 Byte mergt 2 Ebenen zu Punkt-Suche mit 2 Bytes)&#xa;50% Schwelle: Typ B -&gt; Typ C   (Punkt-Suche wird Range-Scan ueber unsigned char Tupel, split 2 Ebenen, Sortierung nach Auftrittswahrscheinlichkeit)&#xa;75% Schwelle: Typ C -&gt; Typ D   (Range-Scan unsigned char wird Range-Scan unsigned short, Merge 2 Ebenen)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Alle 4 Strukturen sind VIELFACHE der Memory-Seitengroesse (4 KiB) - perfektes Alignment garantiert&#xa;Jeder Suchtyp = eigener Allokator-Pool (siehe K05e)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="920" width="2320" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fall12" value="FALL 1 (GPT) - Trie mit &#39;hallo&#39; + &#39;halter&#39;&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Root: PrtArtRedirectNode(&#39;hal&#39;)&#xa;  -&gt; PrtArtBPlusNode (Suchtyp A: Array[256])&#xa;       index[&#39;l&#39;] = Slot 0  -&gt; Redirect(&#39;lo&#39;) + Value-&gt;&#39;hallo&#39;&#xa;       index[&#39;t&#39;] = Slot 1  -&gt; Redirect(&#39;ter&#39;) + Value-&gt;&#39;halter&#39;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#4A148C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1140" width="1140" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fall22" value="FALL 2 (GPT) - &#39;ab&#39; allein, dann &#39;abc&#39; hinzu&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Schritt 1: Root = PrtArtRedirectNode(&#39;ab&#39;) + Value-&gt;&#39;ab&#39;&#xa;Schritt 2 (&#39;abc&#39; insert):&#xa;Root: PrtArtRedirectNode(&#39;ab&#39;) + Value-&gt;&#39;ab&#39;&#xa;  -&gt; PrtArtBPlusNode (Suchtyp A)&#xa;       index[&#39;c&#39;] = Slot 0 -&gt; Value-&gt;&#39;abc&#39;&#xa;Anmerkung (Frage 16): Redirect-Node KANN Value haben + Sub-Node!" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#4A148C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="1140" width="1140" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.3;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;endArrow=block;endFill=0;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="redirect" target="root">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.7;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;endArrow=block;endFill=0;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bplus" target="root">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K05c" name="K05c Virtuelle Memory-Offset-Adressierung">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K05c KONZEPT (REV 6 NEU) - Virtuelle Memory-Offset-Adressierung (TLB-inspired)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#01579B;strokeColor=#003C71;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Quelle: GPT-Antworten Frage 6, 12, 13. PRT-ART ist ein echter ART weil: virtuelle Memory-Offset-Berechnung wie CPU-TLBs" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#01579B;fontColor=#01579B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="formel" value="KERNFORMEL (Frage 6 GPT):&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Fuer Key der Laenge k_count mit Bytes k[0], k[1], ..., k[k_count-1]:&#xa;&#xa;virtuelle_position = sum( k[i] * 256^(k_count - 1 - i) )    fuer i = 0..k_count-1&#xa;&#xa;Beispiel: Key &#39;ab&#39; (k_count=2, k[0]=0x61, k[1]=0x62):&#xa;virtuelle_position = 0x61 * 256 + 0x62 = 0x6162 = 24930&#xa;&#xa;Annahme: &#39;Tiefe des Baumes ist vollstaendig reserviert&#39; = jeder moegliche Praefix hat eigene Value-Adresse" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mapping" value="MAPPING VIRTUELL -&gt; PHYSISCH&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Wie CPU-TLBs: PRT-ART verwaltet einen Virtual-to-Physical-Translation-Layer&#xa;&#xa;virtuelle_position -&gt; Custom-Pool-Allocator -&gt; physische Adresse im Value-Buffer&#xa;&#xa;Wenn die berechnete physische Adresse:&#xa;- INNERHALB des allokierten Bereichs UND nicht deleted -&gt; Value valide&#xa;- AUSSERHALB des allokierten Bereichs ODER deleted-marked -&gt; Key nicht valide -&gt; empty Value oder Exception&#xa;&#xa;Redirect-Knoten zaehlen virtuell wie &#39;festes Sub-Pfad-Character 0&#39; pro komprimiertem Byte (Frage 12, 13)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="420" width="2320" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="concept" value="«concept» IVirtualOffsetCalculator (NEU REV 6)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;+ compute(key : KeyView) const : VirtualOffset&#xa;+ virtual_total_size(k_count : size_t) const : size_t  // = 256^k_count&#xa;+ resolve_physical(virt_offset : VirtualOffset) : optional&lt;PhysicalAddress&gt;&#xa;+ register_physical_block(virt_start, phys_start, size) : void  // Mapping-Eintrag&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Vorteil: lineare arithmetische Adressberechnung statt Pointer-Chasing fuer die Value-Position.&#xa;Nachteil: dirty holes (deleted slots) tolerierbar (siehe K05d - Konsolidierung)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="700" width="2320" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hint" value="WICHTIGE ABGRENZUNG: PRT-ART ist KEIN klassischer ART (mit Node4/16/48/256), sondern eine Verallgemeinerung mit:&#xa;1) Virtueller Offset-Berechnung (TLB-inspired) - Linear-Berechnung statt Pointer-Chasing&#xa;2) 4 internen Suchtypen mit Dichte-Schwellen (siehe K05b)&#xa;3) Linearem Value-Buffer mit Lazy-Deletion (siehe K05d)&#xa;Die Bezeichnung &#39;PRT-ART&#39; = &#39;Permutations-Trie-ART&#39; wuerdigt die ART-Idee, geht aber daruber hinaus." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="960" width="2320" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K05d" name="K05d Linearer Value-Buffer + Lazy Deletion">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K05d KONZEPT (REV 6 NEU) - Linearer Value-Buffer + Lazy-Deletion + Konsolidierung" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#4A148C;strokeColor=#310A66;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Quelle: GPT-Antworten Frage 9, 14, 21, 22. Values streng linear in Insert-Order, niemals bewegen, dirty holes toleriert" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4A148C;fontColor=#4A148C;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="buffer" value="LINEARER VALUE-BUFFER (Frage 9, 14)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;+----------------+----------+----------+----------+----- +-------+&#xa;| Value 0        | Value 1  | Value 2  | dirty    | ...  | EOF   |&#xa;+----------------+----------+----------+----------+----- +-------+&#xa;                                          ^&#xa;                                          | geloeschter Slot (lazy deletion)&#xa;&#xa;Eigenschaften:&#xa;- Values werden streng in Insert-Order linear angehaengt&#xa;- Values werden NIE bewegt waehrend des Betriebs (Performance-Garantie)&#xa;- Loeschen markiert die Stelle als &#39;dirty&#39; (lazy deletion), die Bytes bleiben physisch&#xa;- Pointer-Pfade durch den Trie zeigen auf den Offset im Value-Buffer&#xa;- Bucket-Strategie: jeder Allocator-Bucket = ein std::vector, dynamische Erweiterung (Frage 15)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#4A148C;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cons" value="KONSOLIDIERUNG (Frage 22)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Trigger:&#xa;- dirty_bytes &gt; nutzbare_bytes  (also &gt; 100 Prozent Verschwendung)&#xa;- ODER bei vollstaendiger Loeschung&#xa;- ODER bei expliziter User-Anforderung&#xa;&#xa;Aktion:&#xa;1. Value-Buffer wird einmalig in Order rekopiert&#xa;2. Alle Trie-Pointer werden auf neue Offsets umgebogen&#xa;3. Dirty holes entstehen NICHT mehr (frischer Buffer)&#xa;&#xa;Begruendung (Frage 14 GPT):&#xa;&#39;Wir sind schlecht mit Loeschen. Spaeter wollen wir nodes nah an der Blattebene gruppieren, um jeder ihren eigenen allozierten Speicherbereich zu geben, um bei rebalancing oder Konsolidierung nur wenige Elemente wirklich neu schreiben und kopieren zu muessen.&#39;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8EAF6;strokeColor=#1A237E;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="500" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="check" value="POINTER-VALIDIERUNG (Frage 9)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;IsValidValuePointer(offset) := offset &lt; high_water_mark AND NOT marked_deleted(offset)&#xa;&#xa;Wenn der virtuelle Pointer ausserhalb des allokierten Bereichs zeigt:&#xa;-&gt; Key ist nicht valide -&gt; empty Value oder Exception (gemaess C++23-Metaprogrammierung des Users)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="900" width="2320" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K05e" name="K05e 4+2 Allokator-Pools">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K05e KONZEPT (REV 6 NEU) - 4+2 Allokator-Pools fuer perfektes Alignment" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#E65100;strokeColor=#A04000;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Quelle: GPT-Antworten Frage 25, 28, 29. Je Knoten-Suchtyp + Value-Typ ein eigener Pool fuer perfektes Alignment + Pool-Strategie" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E65100;fontColor=#E65100;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pools" value="4 KNOTEN-POOLS (1 pro Suchtyp) + 2 VALUE-POOLS = 6 Pools total&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Pool A: B+-Knoten mit Suchtyp A (Array[256])              - Alignment 256 B (Cache-Line / Page-Multiple)        - Fixed-Size Slab&#xa;Pool B: B+-Knoten mit Suchtyp B (Array[65535])           - Alignment 64 KiB (16 Pages)                          - Fixed-Size Slab&#xa;Pool C: B+-Knoten mit Suchtyp C (Vector&lt;u8,u8&gt;)          - Alignment 4 KiB (1 Page), variable Fuellung          - Pool mit variabler Vektor-Groesse&#xa;Pool D: B+-Knoten mit Suchtyp D (Vector&lt;u16,u16&gt;)        - Alignment 4 KiB+ Vielfache, variable Fuellung        - Pool mit variabler Vektor-Groesse&#xa;Pool R: Redirect-Knoten (Byte-String + optional Value-Pointer) - Alignment 64 B (Cache-Line)                  - Variable-Size Slab&#xa;Pool V-static: Values mit statischer Groesse (kein Serializer noetig) - bucket-basiert, fixer Slot           - Append-only&#xa;Pool V-dynamic: Values mit dynamischer Groesse + Signaling-Bits-Header - bucket-basiert                      - Append-only" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bucket" value="BUCKET-STRATEGIE (Frage 15 GPT)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;&#39;Wir verwenden dasselbe Prinzip, das je allocator bucket ein vector verwendet, wenn wir weitere Elemente einfuegen. Weil wir eh selbst allozieren und verwalten, gehen wir von sparse Speichernutzung und custom alignment aus.&#39;&#xa;&#xa;Implementation:&#xa;- Jeder Pool besteht aus mehreren Buckets, jeweils ein Vector mit festem Element-Typ&#xa;- Wenn ein Bucket voll: neuer Bucket allokiert + Pool wird virtuell erweitert&#xa;- Buckets sind kontinuierlich virtuell adressiert (via IVirtualOffsetCalculator)&#xa;- Physisch koennen Buckets an unterschiedlichen Stellen liegen (Mapping-Layer)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="500" width="2320" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="concept" value="«concept» IPrtArtAllocator (NEU REV 6)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;+ allocate(pool_kind : PoolKind, size_hint : size_t) : VirtualOffset&#xa;+ deallocate(pool_kind, offset) : void  // markiert dirty, nicht physisches Free&#xa;+ consolidate(pool_kind) : ConsolidationStats  // re-copy + Pointer-Adjust&#xa;+ bucket_count(pool_kind) const : size_t&#xa;+ total_allocated(pool_kind) const : size_t&#xa;+ total_dirty(pool_kind) const : size_t&#xa;━━━━━━━ enum PoolKind ━━━━━━━&#xa;PoolA, PoolB, PoolC, PoolD, PoolR, PoolVStatic, PoolVDynamic&#xa;━━━━━━━ Konkretisierungen ━━━━━━━&#xa;FixedSizeSlabAllocator&lt;PoolA, 256B-Slot&gt; / &lt;PoolB, 65535-Slot&gt; / &lt;PoolR, variable&gt;&#xa;VariableVectorAllocator&lt;PoolC, u8u8&gt; / &lt;PoolD, u16u16&gt;&#xa;AppendOnlyBucketAllocator&lt;PoolVStatic, static_size&gt; / &lt;PoolVDynamic, signaling_bits&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="780" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K05f" name="K05f Signaling-Bits-Serialisierung">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K05f KONZEPT (REV 6 NEU) - Custom Serialisierung mit Signaling Bits" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1A237E;strokeColor=#0D1A66;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Quelle: GPT-Antworten Frage 5, 10. Sparse Length Serialization mit Signaling Bits fuer dynamische Value-Groessen" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A237E;fontColor=#1A237E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="layout" value="SERIALISIERUNGS-LAYOUT (dynamische Value-Groesse, Frage 10)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;+--------------------------------+-----------------------------+----------------------------+&#xa;| Header (1 Byte)                | Length-Bytes (ser_length)   | Payload (value_bytes)      |&#xa;| signaling_bits + len_info_size | tatsaechliche Laenge        | rohe value-Bytes           |&#xa;+--------------------------------+-----------------------------+----------------------------+&#xa;&#xa;Header-Byte:&#xa;- Niedrigste Bits beschreiben, wieviele Bytes zur Laengen-Encodierung folgen (1-8 Bytes typischerweise)&#xa;- Signaling-Bits markieren Spezialfaelle (z.B. statischer Typ, Compression-Flag, etc.)&#xa;&#xa;Gesamtlaenge: 1 + ser_length + value_bytes (Frage 10 wortwoertlich)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vorteile" value="VORTEILE&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;- Kleine Values (0-127 Byte): minimaler Overhead = 1 Header + 1 Length + payload&#xa;- Grosse Values (&gt; 65 KiB): bis zu 8 Bytes Laengen-Header&#xa;- Typ ist fuer PRT-ART transparent — User-Templates definieren statisch zur Compile-Zeit&#xa;&#xa;Frage 5 wortwoertlich:&#xa;&#39;Ein value ist formal ein vom Nutzer serialisiertes Datenobjekt, um dessen Form wir uns nicht scheren, wir speichern alles als unsigned char, also als Bytes ab.&#39;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="500" width="2320" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="concept" value="«concept» IValueSerializer (NEU REV 6)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;+ serialize(value : Value const&amp;, out : ByteBuffer&amp;) : void&#xa;+ deserialize(bytes : span&lt;byte const&gt;) : optional&lt;Value&gt;&#xa;+ is_static_size() const noexcept : bool  // wenn true, kein Header noetig (Pool V-static)&#xa;+ minimum_header_bytes() const noexcept : size_t  // 0 oder 1&#xa;━━━━━━━ Konkretisierungen ━━━━━━━&#xa;«concrete» StaticSizeSerializer&lt;FixedT&gt;&#xa;  - sizeof(FixedT) == compile-time bekannt, kein Header noetig&#xa;«concrete» DynamicSignalingBitsSerializer&#xa;  - Header-Byte + ser_length + value_bytes&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Compile-Time-Auswahl im Template:&#xa;template &lt;typename Value&gt; using AutoSerializer = std::conditional_t&lt;&#xa;    std::is_trivially_copyable_v&lt;Value&gt; AND sizeof(Value) &lt;= 64,&#xa;    StaticSizeSerializer&lt;Value&gt;, DynamicSignalingBitsSerializer&gt;;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="740" width="2320" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K05g" name="K05g Multi-Reader-Writer-Concurrency">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K05g KONZEPT (REV 6 NEU) - Multithreaded Read + Write Concurrency" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#B71C1C;strokeColor=#7C1212;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Quelle: GPT-Antworten Frage 33. PRT-ART unterstuetzt von Anfang an parallelen Read UND Write. PRAEZISIERT Invariante I6 aus Termin 2." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B71C1C;fontColor=#B71C1C;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i6" value="ANPASSUNG INVARIANTE I6 (Termin 2 PRAEZISIERT REV 6)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;ALT (REV 5): Concurrency bleibt im Kernumfang auf spaetere Erweiterung begrenzt; Single-Thread + Read-Scaling-Vorbereitung&#xa;&#xa;NEU (REV 6 aus Frage 33): Concurrency ist NICHT auf spaetere Erweiterung begrenzt.&#xa;PRT-ART unterstuetzt Multi-Threading fuer Read und Write durch:&#xa;1. Lock-free Reader (Standard)&#xa;2. Reservierte Value-Speicher-Bloecke pro Writer (sequentielle Allokation)&#xa;3. Parallele Index-Updates auf disjunkten Node-Bereichen (Konflikt-Detection notwendig)&#xa;4. Konflikt-Resolution via OLC (Optimistic Lock Coupling, siehe S30 in K06)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ops" value="KONKURRENTE OPERATIONEN&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;READ:&#xa;- Standard parallel ohne Synchronisation (Lock-free dank linearem Value-Buffer)&#xa;- Trie-Navigation: optimistic readers, kein Lock&#xa;- Value-Read: nur Adresse + Length-Read (atomic)&#xa;&#xa;WRITE:&#xa;- Parallel WENN die zu beruehrenden Nodes nicht konfligieren ueber den Gesamtbereich&#xa;- Values werden in sequentiell reservierte Speicher-Bloecke kopiert (jeder Writer hat eigenen Block-Reservation-Token)&#xa;- Index-Updates erfolgen parallel auf disjunkten Node-Bereichen&#xa;- Konflikt: OLC-Restart oder Wait" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="460" width="2320" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="concept" value="«concept» IPrtArtConcurrencyManager (NEU REV 6)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;+ reserve_value_block(writer_id : ThreadId, size_hint : size_t) : VirtualOffset&#xa;+ lock_node_range(start, end, mode : Read|Write) : NodeLock&#xa;+ detect_conflict(write_set_a : NodeSet, write_set_b : NodeSet) : bool&#xa;+ resolve_conflict(strategy : OlcRestart|Wait|Abort) : ResolutionResult&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Beziehung zu S30 in K06: Concurrency-Strategien-innerhalb-Page&#xa;- OLC (Optimistic Lock Coupling) - PRT-ART default&#xa;- ROWEX / RCU / HazardPointers / EpochBased / etc. als Alternativen waehlbar&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Compile-Time Template-Parameter (siehe K05/Frage 30+31):&#xa;template &lt;typename ConcurrencyStrategy = OlcMultiWriter&gt; class prt_art;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="800" width="2320" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="K05h" name="K05h 3 kanonische Fallbeispiele">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="K05h KONZEPT (REV 6 NEU) - 3 kanonische Fallbeispiele aus GPT-Antworten" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#311B92;strokeColor=#1A0E5C;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="3 Test-Faelle fuer Phase-6-Implementation. Dienen als Reference-Implementation der Trie-Bauten + Lookup-Pfade" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#311B92;fontColor=#311B92;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fall1" value="FALL 1: Trie mit &#39;hallo&#39; + &#39;halter&#39;&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Root: PrtArtRedirectNode(&#39;hal&#39;)&#xa;  |&#xa;  +-- PrtArtBPlusNode (Suchtyp A: Array[256])&#xa;        | index[&#39;l&#39;] = Slot 0&#xa;        | index[&#39;t&#39;] = Slot 1&#xa;        |&#xa;        +-- Slot 0: PrtArtRedirectNode(&#39;lo&#39;) + ValueHandle -&gt; &#39;hallo&#39;-Value&#xa;        +-- Slot 1: PrtArtRedirectNode(&#39;ter&#39;) + ValueHandle -&gt; &#39;halter&#39;-Value&#xa;&#xa;Lookup &#39;hallo&#39;:&#xa;1. Root Redirect: vergleicht &#39;hal&#39; mit Key-Praefix -&gt; match&#xa;2. B+-Node Array[256]: index[&#39;l&#39;] = Slot 0&#xa;3. Slot 0 Redirect: vergleicht &#39;lo&#39; mit Key-Rest -&gt; match&#xa;4. ValueHandle laden + zurueckgeben" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fall2" value="FALL 2: &#39;ab&#39; allein, dann &#39;abc&#39; hinzu (Frage 16)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Schritt 1: nur &#39;ab&#39; gespeichert:&#xa;Root: PrtArtRedirectNode(&#39;ab&#39;) + ValueHandle -&gt; &#39;ab&#39;-Value&#xa;&#xa;Schritt 2: &#39;abc&#39; wird eingefuegt:&#xa;Root: PrtArtRedirectNode(&#39;ab&#39;) + ValueHandle -&gt; &#39;ab&#39;-Value&#xa;  |&#xa;  +-- NEU eingefuegte B+-Node (Suchtyp A: Array[256])&#xa;        | index[&#39;c&#39;] = Slot 0&#xa;        |&#xa;        +-- Slot 0: ValueHandle -&gt; &#39;abc&#39;-Value&#xa;&#xa;WICHTIG (Frage 16 GPT):&#xa;&#39;Eine redirect node hat ebenfalls keinen nullpointer als value,&#xa;sondern einen Wert, wenn der Rest string nicht fuer das letzte&#xa;Element in einer B+ Knoten node (regulaer) landen sollte.&#39;&#xa;-&gt; Root-Redirect KANN sowohl Value haben (fuer &#39;ab&#39;) als auch Sub-B+-Node (fuer &#39;abc&#39;)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="160" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fall3" value="FALL 3: nur &#39;haus&#39; gespeichert, Lookup &#39;hafen&#39;&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Root: PrtArtRedirectNode(&#39;haus&#39;) + ValueHandle -&gt; &#39;haus&#39;-Value&#xa;&#xa;Lookup &#39;hafen&#39;:&#xa;1. Root Redirect: vergleicht &#39;haus&#39; mit &#39;hafen&#39;&#xa;2. Byte-by-Byte-Compare (Frage 17):&#xa;   - &#39;h&#39; = &#39;h&#39; ok&#xa;   - &#39;a&#39; = &#39;a&#39; ok&#xa;   - &#39;u&#39; != &#39;f&#39; MISMATCH&#xa;3. Algorithmus liefert leere Value oder Exception&#xa;   (gemaess C++23-Metaprogrammierung des Users)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Bedeutung: Frueher Abbruch wenn Redirect-Vergleich fehlschlaegt.&#xa;Performanz: O(min(|key|, |redirect|)) statt Pointer-Chasing." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="580" width="1140" height="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="splits" value="SPLIT-/COMPACTION-LOGIK (Frage 23, 24)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Split bei Redirect-Knoten-Divergenz:&#xa;- Anfang (erstes Byte): Erstes Byte wird in neue B+-Node extrahiert, Rest verschoben&#xa;- Mitte: Aufteilung in 1. Redirect vor Stelle, B+-Node an Stelle, 2. Redirect nach Stelle&#xa;- Ende: letztes Byte als B+-Node-Eintrag, Rest bleibt in Redirect&#xa;&#xa;Compaction beim Loeschen:&#xa;- Knoten ohne Kind koennen wieder in Redirect-Knoten gemergt werden&#xa;- B+-Node wird geloescht, Byte wird zurueck in Redirect-String eingefuegt&#xa;- Nodes vor und nach Redirect werden verbunden" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#4A148C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="580" width="1140" height="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hint" value="PHASE-6-IMPLEMENTATION-TEST-FAELLE&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Test-Suite muss diese 3 Faelle reproduzieren koennen.&#xa;Locations (siehe REV 6 md §9):&#xa;- comdare-cache-engine/prt_art/tests/fall_1_hallo_halter.cpp&#xa;- comdare-cache-engine/prt_art/tests/fall_2_ab_then_abc.cpp&#xa;- comdare-cache-engine/prt_art/tests/fall_3_haus_lookup_hafen.cpp&#xa;Diese sind kanonische Akzeptanz-Tests fuer die PRT-ART-Implementation." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="960" width="2320" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="U10" name="U10 comdare::prt_art + IPermutationEngine + CacheEngineBuilder">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="2000" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="2200" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="U10 UML (REV 6 ERWEITERT 2026-05-12) - comdare::prt_art + Beziehung zu IPermutationEngine + CacheEngineBuilder" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#01579B;strokeColor=#003C71;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="PRT-ART als experimentelle ExecutionEngine im Permutations-Setup. CacheEngineBuilder steuert IPermutationEngine, die jede ExecutionEngine durch alle Permutationen schickt." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#01579B;fontColor=#01579B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="prtart" value="template &lt;...&gt;&#xa;class comdare::prt_art : public ISearchEngine&lt;Key, Value&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━ Template-Parameter ━━━━━━━&#xa;Key                          - KeyView (immer unsigned char Bytes intern)&#xa;Value                        - beliebiger User-Typ&#xa;SerializationStrategy = AutoSerializer        - statisch/dynamisch&#xa;AllocatorA = DefaultPoolA    - Pool A (Array[256])&#xa;AllocatorB = DefaultPoolB    - Pool B (Array[65535])&#xa;AllocatorC = DefaultPoolC    - Pool C (Vector&lt;u8,u8&gt;)&#xa;AllocatorD = DefaultPoolD    - Pool D (Vector&lt;u16,u16&gt;)&#xa;AllocatorR = DefaultPoolR    - Pool R (Redirect)&#xa;AllocatorV = DefaultPoolV    - Pool V (Value-Buffer)&#xa;TypeTransitionPolicy = StandardThresholdsPolicy  - 25/50/75%&#xa;FingerprintFilter = NoFingerprint                - optional Vorfilter&#xa;ConcurrencyStrategy = OlcMultiWriter             - Read+Write parallel&#xa;━━━━━━━ Attribute (private) ━━━━━━━&#xa;- root_node_ : IPrtArtNode*  (Redirect oder B+-Node)&#xa;- offset_calculator_ : IVirtualOffsetCalculator&#xa;- allocators_ : tuple&lt;PoolA, PoolB, PoolC, PoolD, PoolR, PoolV-static, PoolV-dynamic&gt;&#xa;- concurrency_manager_ : IPrtArtConcurrencyManager&#xa;- serializer_ : SerializationStrategy" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="2320" height="520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ops" value="━━━━━━━ Pflicht-Operationen (Termin 1+2 Vergleichsmatrix + GPT Frage 2) ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ optional&lt;Value&gt; lookup(Key const&amp; key) const                                  - exact lookup&#xa;+ optional&lt;Value&gt; lookup_or_default(Key, Value) const                            - unsuccessful exact&#xa;+ prefix_iterator prefix_lookup(Key const&amp; prefix) const                         - prefix match&#xa;+ prefix_iterator prefix_lookup_with_flag(Key prefix) const                       - GPT Frage 2: tuple&lt;Key-Rest, Value&gt;-Sequenz&#xa;+ iterator prefix_enumeration(Key const&amp; prefix) const                            - forward enumeration&#xa;+ range_iterator range_scan(Key begin, Key end) const                            - lex-Modus&#xa;+ pair&lt;iterator, bool&gt; insert(value_type const&amp;)                                  - lazy insertion in Pool V&#xa;+ size_type erase(Key const&amp;)                                                     - lazy delete (Pool V dirty-marker)&#xa;+ template&lt;V&gt; void update(Key, V&amp;&amp;)                                              - lazy replace&#xa;+ static prt_art bulk_build(span&lt;value_type&gt; sorted_pairs)                       - bulk via Pool A initial&#xa;+ ConsolidationStats compact_rebuild()                                            - Frage 22: rekopiert Value-Buffer&#xa;━━━━━━━ Iteratoren (Pflicht REV 5 + REV 6 ergaenzt prefix_lookup_with_flag) ━━━━━━━&#xa;iterator (forward mut) / const_iterator / reverse_iterator / const_reverse_iterator&#xa;range_iterator (lex / getrange-Semantik) / key_iterator / value_iterator&#xa;prefix_iterator (NEU REV 5+6 mit Flag-Mode fuer tuple&lt;Key-Rest, Value&gt;)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="700" width="2320" height="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nodefam" value="━━━━━━━ IPrtArtNode Familie (REV 6 NEU) ━━━━━━━&#xa;class IPrtArtNode  (Wurzel)&#xa;  class PrtArtRedirectNode : IPrtArtNode&#xa;    - compressed_bytes : vector&lt;byte&gt;&#xa;    - value_handle : optional&lt;ValueHandle&lt;Value&gt;&gt;  (terminal)&#xa;    - next_node : optional&lt;IPrtArtNode*&gt;          (sub B+-Node oder weitere Redirect)&#xa;  class PrtArtBPlusNode : IPrtArtNode&#xa;    - current_search_type : SearchTypeKind&#xa;    - search_type_data : variant&lt;SearchTypeA, SearchTypeB, SearchTypeC, SearchTypeD&gt;&#xa;    - density : double  (0.0..1.0)&#xa;    class SearchTypeA  - Array[256]&#xa;    class SearchTypeB  - Array[65535]&#xa;    class SearchTypeC  - Vector&lt;tuple&lt;u8,u8&gt;&gt; range scan, sortiert Auftrittswahrscheinlichkeit&#xa;    class SearchTypeD  - Vector&lt;tuple&lt;u16,u16&gt;&gt; range scan, sortiert Auftrittswahrscheinlichkeit" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1200" width="2320" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="layer_perm" value="PERMUTATIONS-STEUERUNG (NEU REV 6 ERWEITERT 2026-05-12) - jede ExecutionEngine wird durch IPermutationEngine im Cache-Engine-Framework gesteuert" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#FFE0B2;strokeColor=#E65100;fontColor=#E65100;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1500" width="2320" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="builder" value="«concept» CacheEngineBuilder (Master-Orchestrator)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ build_for_engine(engine : IExecutingEngine&amp;) : void&#xa;+ enumerate_permutations() : list&lt;PermutationDescriptor&gt;&#xa;+ start_experiment_loop() : void  (Phase 7)&#xa;+ collect_results() : MeasurementBuffer&amp;&#xa;━━━━━━━ besitzt ━━━━━━━&#xa;- permutation_engine_ : IPermutationEngine&amp;&#xa;- cache_engine_ : ICacheEngine&amp;  (12 Sub-Engines C1-C12)&#xa;- platform_probe_ : IPlatformProbe&amp;  (5-Schritt Auto-Discovery)&#xa;━━━━━━━ steuert ━━━━━━━&#xa;- jede registrierte ExecutionEngine durch alle Permutationen&#xa;- inkl. PRT-ART, ART, HOT, START, B^2, CoCo, Masstree, Wormhole" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F5FE;strokeColor=#01579B;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1540" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="permeng" value="«concept» IPermutationEngine (Permutations-Steuerung)&#xa;━━━━━━━ Methoden ━━━━━━━&#xa;+ register_engine(engine : IExecutingEngine&amp;) : void&#xa;+ enumerate_for(engine_kind : EngineKind) : list&lt;PermutationDescriptor&gt;&#xa;+ apply_permutation(desc : PermutationDescriptor) : ConfiguredEngine&#xa;+ execute_one(perm : PermutationDescriptor, workload : Workload) : MeasurementRecord&#xa;━━━━━━━ Permutations-Achsen pro ExecutionEngine ━━━━━━━&#xa;Generic (alle Algorithmen):&#xa;- D5 Saeule-A-Strategie-Permutationen (S1-S30)&#xa;- D6 Saeule-B-Cache-Familien (C1-C12)&#xa;- D7 Engine-Choice (V1-V4)&#xa;PRT-ART-spezifisch (NUR wenn ExecutionEngine == PRT-ART):&#xa;- D10 Suchtyp-Reihenfolge (6 Permutationen)&#xa;- D11 Dichte-Schwellen (kalibriert oder Standard)&#xa;- D12 Fingerprint-Filter (an/aus)&#xa;- D13 Serialization (statisch/dynamisch)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="1540" width="1140" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hint_perm" value="WICHTIG: Die comdare::prt_art-Klasse oben ist EINE registerbare ExecutionEngine. Andere Algorithmen (ART, HOT, START, B^2-Tree, CoCo, Masstree, Wormhole) sind ebenfalls registerbar und werden durch DIESELBE IPermutationEngine im Cache-Engine-Framework permutiert.&#xa;Damit ist die Cache-Engine-Universalitaet erhalten - PRT-ART ist nur EIN Test-Algorithmus zur Validierung der Erweiterbarkeit." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1940" width="2320" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_builder_perm" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;endArrow=open;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="builder" target="permeng">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r_builder_lbl" value="steuert" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;background=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#E65100;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="r_builder_perm">
          <mxGeometry x="-0.1" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="REV7M" name="REV7-Master Drei-Repo-Architektur (V31 Stand)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2400" dy="2000" grid="1" gridSize="20" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="2200" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rev7stamp" value="REV7 Stand 2026-05-15 / V31.F / K-H Konsolidierungs-Sprint - siehe Tab REV7-Master fuer Snapshot" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="0" width="700" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t" value="REV7-Master (NEU K-H.6, 2026-05-15) - Drei-Repo-Architektur Stand V31" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#0D47A1;strokeColor=#072F66;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Konsolidierte Sicht: cache-engine (WIE/Werkzeug) + prt-art (Pruefling) + Diplomarbeit/Code/ (WAS/Auswertung). Stand 2026-05-15: V31.F mit 22 Adaptern + P27 hp-soft + libs/-Migration." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0D47A1;fontColor=#0D47A1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
