        <mxCell id="sota_list" value="P01 ART       - unodb-Adapter (Apache-2.0) [V31.K1 PILOT]&#xa;P02 HOT       - HOT-Original (BSD)&#xa;P03 Masstree  - Masstree-beta (BSD)&#xa;P04 CoCo-Trie - GPL-3 (Architekt-Direktive II OK)&#xa;P05 START     - umbra-START (MIT)&#xa;P06 SuRF      - keine LICENSE (Architekt-Direktive II OK)&#xa;P07 Wormhole  - GPL-2 (Architekt-Direktive II OK)&#xa;P08 ART-Sync  - umbra-ART-Sync (MIT)&#xa;P10 SuRF      - SuRF-Tu (BSD-2)&#xa;P11 CSS-Tree  - eigene Re-Impl (P11 legacy_reimpl)&#xa;P19 PSL-LSM   - eigener Adapter&#xa;P30 Hazard    - hazard_pointers (MIT)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
