        <mxCell id="t" value="P27 hp-soft + Bundle-Prefetcher (NEU K-H.8, 2026-05-15) - Build-Time-Tool + Runtime L1/L2/L3" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#4A148C;strokeColor=#2D0E5A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2320" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="P27 Zhang/Grot ASPLOS 2025 (Hierarchical Prefetching). hp-soft.zip (1981 B) am 2026-05-14 vom Autor erhalten. V31.K5 hp_soft.py -&gt; C++23 Port. V31.K6 HierarchicalBundlePrefetcher Runtime aus Paper re-implementiert." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4A148C;fontColor=#4A148C;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bt_hdr" value="BUILD-TIME: hp_soft (Call-Graph-Analyse)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#E1BEE7;strokeColor=#4A148C;fontColor=#4A148C;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="1140" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bt" value="Original (Zhang): hp_soft.py&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Phase 1: Call-Graph-Extraction&#xa;  - Parse C++ Source (libclang AST)&#xa;  - Extract caller -&gt; callee Edges&#xa;  - Identifiziert Hot Paths&#xa;&#xa;Phase 2: Bundle-Identifikation&#xa;  - Cluster nahe Funktionsaufrufe in Bundles&#xa;  - Bundle-Granularitaet = Cache-Line (64 B)&#xa;&#xa;Phase 3: Prefetch-Hint-Emission&#xa;  - Generiert __builtin_prefetch() Markierungen&#xa;  - Emittiert in #include prefetch_hints.h&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Comdare-Port (V31.K5):&#xa;Path: comdare-prt-art/hp_soft/hp_soft.cpp + .hpp&#xa;Sprache: C++23 (KEIN Python in Build-Pipeline, Memory-Direktive)&#xa;Tool: hp_soft Build-Time-Binary&#xa;CMake-Hook: add_custom_command(... hp_soft ...) vor compile" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#4A148C;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="200" width="1140" height="500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rt_hdr" value="RUNTIME: HierarchicalBundlePrefetcher (Paper-Reimpl)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#FFCCBC;strokeColor=#BF360C;fontColor=#BF360C;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="160" width="1140" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rt" value="HierarchicalBundlePrefetcher&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;L1-Bundle: 64 B (Cache-Line)&#xa;L2-Bundle: 256 B (4 L1-Bundles)&#xa;L3-Bundle: 4 KB (Page)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Methoden:&#xa;+ prefetch_l1(addr) -&gt; void  // 1 Cache-Line&#xa;+ prefetch_l2(addr) -&gt; void  // 4 Cache-Lines&#xa;+ prefetch_l3(addr) -&gt; void  // 64 Cache-Lines&#xa;+ choose_level(distance) -&gt; PrefetchLevel&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Distance-Estimator:&#xa;  near (&lt; 64 B)  -&gt; L1&#xa;  mid  (64-256 B) -&gt; L2&#xa;  far  (&gt; 256 B)  -&gt; L3&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Comdare-Port (V31.K6):&#xa;Path: comdare-prt-art/prefetch/hierarchical_bundle_prefetcher.hpp + .cpp&#xa;Tests: 5 Stueck (L1, L2, L3, choose_level, integrierter Lookup)&#xa;Status: Tests gruen, Microbenchmark pending" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBE9E7;strokeColor=#BF360C;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="200" width="1140" height="500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="paper_ref" value="PAPER-REFERENZ&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;P27 Zhang/Grot et al. (ASPLOS 2025): Hierarchical Prefetching for Cache-Aware Tree Indexes&#xa;Erhaltenes Material: hp-soft.zip (1981 B) - 2026-05-14 vom Autor (Email-Antwort)&#xa;User-Hinweis (in Memory): Zhang ist stolzer + zynischer Mensch, mehr kommt nicht&#xa;Status: P27 ABGESCHLOSSEN, keine weiteren Folge-Mails geplant" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="720" width="2320" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x_ref" value="CROSS-REFERENZ&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Adapter-Familie (K-H.7): Adapter-Familie 22 V31-Adapter Tab&#xa;Forschungslandkarte: docs/forschungslandkarte/06_cluster_E_prefetching_telemetry.md (P27)&#xa;Bausteine-Matrix: docs/bausteine/01_bausteine_matrix.md (Achse 7 PREFETCH)&#xa;Memory: ~/.claude/.../memory/reference_p27_zhang_no_more_input.md" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#1B5E20;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="860" width="2320" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
