        <mxCell id="migr_summary" value="MIGRATIONS-DELTA (V8-V29 -&gt; V30 Endstand)&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;V8-V11: Initial-Layout (experiment/, search_engine/, cache_engine/builder/, engine_choice/)&#xa;V23.A: Cleanup (build-Dirs, .gitignore, CMakePresets) + Tag v22-final&#xa;V23.B: apps/cache_engine_builder/ extrahieren&#xa;V23.C: libs/common/ aufbauen&#xa;V23.D: (PLAN libs/domain/) - SPAETER VERWORFEN durch User-Direktive Option C+&#xa;V23.E: prt_art/-Subsumption&#xa;V23.F: test_infra + adapters + Final-Verifikation&#xa;V24.A-E: prt-art Cleanup + Diplomarbeit Code/ Cleanup + PROJECT_LAYER_MAPs&#xa;V30.D.1-D.5: libs/-Migration OHNE domain/ (User-Direktive Option C+, Memory-verankert)&#xa;V31.K1-K6: Adapter-Inhalte + P27 hp-soft + NOTICE Architekt-Direktive II&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;Sessions: docs/sessions/20260514-4300-v30-final-libs-migration-done.md (Anker V30)&#xa;Bausteine: docs/bausteine/04_architekturentscheidungen_F1_F15.md F-EXTRA-7 libs/-Layout" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
